<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Marcos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Marcos</para>
  <para style="toc2">Marcos</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mar</para>
  <para style="mt2">Evanjelhu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Marcos</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">João Sarani Nain prepara dalan ba Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateus 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lucas 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">João 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Nee Liafuan Diak kona ba Maromak nia Oan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos husi tempu antigu barak. Balu hakerek “Maromak nia Oan”, balu lae.</char></note> Jesus Kristu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Liafuan Kristu dehan, Ema ida nebee Maromak hili nanis ona atu salva ita ema i ukun ita. </char></note> Liafuan Diak nee hahuu hanesan tuir mai nee. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Hori uluk kedas profeta Isaias hakerek Maromak nia lia menon kona ba ema nebee prepara dalan ba Jesus. Maromak dehan nunee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Rona mai! Hau haruka Hau nia ema ida baa uluk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">hodi prepara dalan ba O.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malakias 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Nia sei foo sai ho lian makaas iha rai fuik maran dehan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Imi tenki hadia dalan atu simu ita nia Nai.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="MRK 1:3">Halo loos tiha dalan nebee kleuk para Nia lao tuir.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isaias 40:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Ema nee mak João Sarani Nain. Nia baa iha rai fuik maran hodi foo hatene ba povu dehan, “Hakribi ona imi nia sala hodi mai sarani, para Maromak hamoos imi nia sala.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ema barak mai husi provinsia Judeia laran tomak ho sidade Jerusalém. Sira foo sai sira nia sala, depois João foo sarani sira iha mota Jordaun. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />João hatais hena nebee halo husi kuda kamelu nia fulun, i nia sintu halo husi animal nia kulit.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Liurai 1:8</ref></char></note> Nia hahaan mak gafanhotu ho bani been. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nia foo sai dehan, “Iha Ema ida boot liu hau sei mai, atu hakruuk hodi kore deit Nia sandalias talin mos, hau la serve. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Hau foo sarani imi ho bee deit, maibee Nia sei foo sarani imi hodi Espiritu Santu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">João foo sarani Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateus 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Lucas 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Iha tempu nebaa Jesus mai husi aldeia Nazaré iha provinsia Galileia ba iha mota Jordaun, i João foo sarani Nia iha mota nee. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Sarani hotu tiha Jesus sai husi bee laran. Derepenti Nia haree lalehan nakloke, i Maromak nia Espiritu hanesan manu pombu tuun ba iha Nia. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Depois lian ida husi lalehan dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:11">“O mak Hau nia Oan doben.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:11">O halo Hau nia laran haksolok teb-tebes.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Jénesis 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Salmu 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isaias 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mateus 3:17</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Marcos 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lucas 3:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satanás koko Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateus 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Lucas 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hotu tiha Espiritu Santu lori kedas Jesus ba iha rai fuik maran. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Durante loron haat-nulu, kalan haat-nulu Jesus hela iha rai fuik maran iha animal fuik nia leet, i Satanás koko Nia fila-fila. Maibee anju sira serbi Nia.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus hahuu hanorin iha Galileia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateus 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Lucas 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Iha loron ida, ema kaer João Sarani Nain hodi baa dadur iha komarka. João tama tiha komarka, Jesus baa iha provinsia Galileia hodi foo sai Maromak nia Liafuan Diak. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Iha nebaa Nia dehan, “Tempu too ona. La kleur tan Maromak sei ukun imi. Nee duni, hakribi ona imi nia sala hodi fiar Liafuan Diak.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mateus 3:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus bolu peskador nain haat atu tuir Nia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateus 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Lucas 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Iha loron ida Jesus lao liu husi tasi ibun Galileia. Nia haree peskador nain rua, Simão ho nia alin André soe hela dai iha tasi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Jesus hatete ba sira, “Mai tuir Hau! Imi nee peskador ikan nian, maibee agora Hau sei hanorin imi atu sai peskador ba ema.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Sira mos husik kedas sira nia dai hodi tuir Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Depois Jesus lao tan uitoan, Nia haree Zebedeu nia oan nain rua, Tiago ho João hadia hela redi iha sira nia roo laran. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Jesus bolu kedas sira nain rua atu tuir Nia. Sira mos husik sira nia aman Zebedeu iha roo laran hamutuk ho ema nebee servisu ho sira. Depois sira nain rua baa tuir Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus duni sai espiritu aat husi ema ida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Lucas 4:31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira baa iha sidade Kafarnaum. Iha loron Sabadu Jesus baa iha uma kreda i komesa hanorin.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Loron Sabadu mak ema Judeu sira nia loron deskansa. Iha loron nee, sira baa iha uma kreda.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Ema nebee rona nee admira, tanba Nia hanorin ho kbiit, la hanesan ho mestri relijiaun sira nia hanorin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28-29">Mateus 7:28-29</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Iha uma kreda laran, iha mos mane ida espiritu aat domina hela nia. Derepenti nia hakilar dehan, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Jesus, Ema Nazaré. O hakarak halo saida ba ami? O mai atu halakon ami ka? Hau hatene O. O mak Ema Santu nebee Maromak haruka mai.”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Maibee Jesus siak espiritu aat dehan, “Nonook! Sai husi ema nee!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Depois espiritu aat doko makaas ema nee i hakilar makaas hodi sai husi nia. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Ema hotu admira hodi husu ba malu dehan, “Saida mak nee? Hanorin nee foun! Ema nee nia hanorin iha kbiit. Too Nia foo orden ba espiritu aat mos, espiritu aat halo tuir.”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Entaun saida mak Jesus halo nee ema konta ba-mai too ema iha provinsia Galileia tomak rona.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura Simão Pedro nia banin feto ho ema barak tan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateus 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Lucas 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Bainhira Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira sai husi uma kreda, Jesus baa tama kedas iha Simão ho André nia uma. Tiago ho João mos tuir. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Momentu nee Simão nia banin feto isin manas toba hela iha kama. Ema konta kedas nia moras nee ba Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Nunee Jesus baa kaer senhora nee nia liman hodi ajuda nia hadeer. Derepenti nia isin manas lakon tiha, i nia hadeer kedas baa prepara hahaan foo ba sira.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Loro matan monu ona, ema barak mai lori sira nia maluk sira nebee moras ka diabu tama iha laran. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Ema husi sidade nee tomak mai halibur iha uma oin. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jesus kura ema barak nebee moras oi-oin deit. Nia mos duni sai diabu husi ema barak. Nia bandu diabu sira la bele koalia, tanba sira konhese hela Nia.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus hanorin Liafuan Diak iha uma kreda barak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Lucas 4:42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Iha dadeer-saan nakukun, Jesus hadeer, Nia sai husi uma baa iha rai fuik ida hodi halo orasaun. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simão ho nia kolega sira seluk sai baa buka Nia. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Bainhira sira hetan Nia, sira dehan, “Ema hotu-hotu buka Ita Boot!”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Maibee Jesus hataan, “Mai ita baa iha aldeia sira nebee besik atu Hau bele foo sai Maromak nia liafuan iha fatin sira nee. Tanba Hau mai atu halo ida nee duni.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Nunee Jesus lao haleu provinsia Galileia tomak hodi hanorin iha sira nia uma kreda i duni sai diabu husi ema.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mateus 4:23</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9:35</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema moras lepra ida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateus 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Lucas 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Iha mane ida moras lepra mai hakneak iha Jesus nia oin hodi husu tulun dehan, “Nai, Ita Boot iha kbiit atu kura hau nia moras hodi halo hau nia isin sai moos fali, naran katak Ita Boot hakarak.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesus hanoin ema nee, nunee Nia lolo liman ba tau iha ema nee nia isin hodi dehan, “Hau hakarak. O diak ona ba!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Derepenti ema nee nia moras lakon, i nia isin sai moos tiha. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Depois Jesus haruka nia baa ona, i hameno dehan, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />“La bele konta sai buat nee ba ema seluk. Maibee baa aprezenta aan iha nai lulik, atu nia haree katak o nia isin moos ona. Depois foo oferta tuir lei Moisés nian, para ema hotu bele hatene katak o diak ona.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Levítiku 14:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Maibee ema nee baa foo sai lemo-lemo katak Jesus kura tiha ona nia moras. Nunee Jesus la bele hatudu Aan ona iha sidade laran. Nia baa hela tiha iha rai fuik. Maski nunee ema husi fatin nebee-nebee deit baa nafatin iha Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema ida liman-ain mate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateus 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Lucas 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Liu tiha loron ida-rua, Jesus fila fali ba Kafarnaum. Ema rona katak Jesus mai fali ona. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Nunee ema nadodon mai sena malu metin iha uma laran, too iha odamatan oin mos, ema nakonu. Depois Jesus foo sai Maromak nia liafuan ba sira.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Jesus koalia dadauk, ema nain haat mai hulan mane ida liman-ain mate atu lori ba Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Maibee iha uma laran ema nakonu, too sira obriga atu tama mos, tama la diak. Entaun sira lori nia sae ba iha uma leten, i sira sobu uma kakuluk halo kuak hodi hatuun nia ho nia toba fatin, iha loos Jesus nia oin. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Bainhira Jesus haree sira nia fiar, Nia dehan ba ema isin mate nee, “Oan, o nia sala hamoos tiha ona.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Iha mos mestri relijiaun balu tuur hela iha nebaa. Sira komesa hanoin dehan, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Nusaa mak Nia koalia fali nunee? Nia hatete aat Maromak! So Maromak deit mak bele hamoos ema nia sala.”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Jesus hatene kedas sira nia hanoin, entaun Nia husu sira, “Nusaa mak imi hanoin nunee? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Se Hau dehan ba ema liman-ain mate nee katak, nia sala hamoos tiha ona, imi seidauk hatene, sai duni nunee ka lae. Maibee se Hau haruka nia hamriik ona hodi lori nia toba fatin i lao, imi bele haree ho matan. <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Agora Hau sei hatudu mo-moos ba imi katak iha mundu nee Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan iha kbiit hodi hamoos ema nia sala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:10">Nunee Jesus hatete ba ema liman-ain mate nee dehan, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Hamriik ona! Foti o nia toba fatin hodi fila ba uma.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Ema nee hamriik kedas, i foti nia toba fatin hodi lao sai ba liur. Ema hotu iha fatin nee haree, i sira admira hodi hahii Maromak dehan, “Ita foin mak haree buat ida hanesan nee.”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus bolu Levi para tuir Nia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateus 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Lucas 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Hotu tiha Jesus sai ba iha tasi ibun Galileia, ema barak mai hasoru Nia, i Nia komesa hanorin sira. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Jesus lao dadauk, Nia haree kobrador impostu ida naran Levi, Alfeu nia oan tuur hela iha nia servisu fatin. Jesus dehan ba nia, “Mai tuir Hau!” Levi mos hamriik hodi tuir Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Depois Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira baa haan iha Levi nia uma, i kobrador impostu barak ho ema aat sira seluk mos haan hamutuk ho sira. Tanba ema hanesan nee, barak mak tuir Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Iha mestri relijiaun balu husi grupu Farizeu haree Jesus haan hamutuk ho kobrador impostu ho ema aat sira. Nunee sira husu ba Jesus nia eskolante sira, “Nusaa mak Nia haan hamutuk fali ho kobrador impostu ho ema aat sira nee?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Bainhira Jesus rona sira nia liafuan nee, Nia dehan ba sira, “So ema moras mak presiza doutor, ema isin diak lae. Hau mai atu bolu ema aat sira, laos atu bolu ema nebee konsidera nia aan moris loos ona.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tansaa mak Nai Jesus nia eskolante sira la jejun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateus 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Lucas 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Iha loron ida João Sarani Nain nia eskolante sira ho mos ema Farizeu sira halo jejun. Ema balu mai husu Jesus nunee: “Ema nebee tuir João Sarani Nain halo jejun. Ema Farizeu sira nia eskolante sira mos hanesan. Maibee tansaa mak Ita Boot nia eskolante sira la jejun?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jesus hataan ho komparasaun dehan, “Hau hanesan noivu ida nebee selebra nia festa kazamentu. Bainhira noivu sei hamutuk ho nia bainaka sira, sira bele jejun ka? La bele! Durante noivu iha hela sira nia klaran, sira la bele jejun. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Maibee too iha loron ida, ema sei lori lakon tiha noivu nee. Iha loron nee mak nia bainaka sira sei jejun.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />La iha ema ida uza hena foun hodi taka fali ba hena bosan nebee kuak. Se lae, hena foun dada hamutuk sai kiik tiha too estraga fali hena bosan nee halo naklees liu tan.<verse eid="MRK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Nunee mos ema halo tua, la tau iha tua fatin nebee halo husi animal nia kulit nebee tuan ona. Tanba tua foun sempre nafurin sae hodi halo kulit tuan nee nakfera tanba toos tiha ona. Nunee tua mos fakar sai. Tua foun, tenki tau iha tua fatin foun.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:22: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nunee Nai Jesus hanorin katak, la bele kahur Nia hanorin nebee foun ho ema Farizeu sira nia hanorin nebee tuan.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus mak loron Sabadu nia Nain</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateus 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Lucas 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Iha loron Sabadu ida, Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira lao liu husi ema nia toos. Sira lao dadauk, nia eskolante sira komesa korut trigu musan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Deuteronómiu 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Haree nunee, ema husi grupu Farizeu hasee Jesus dehan, “Haree took. Sira servisu fali iha loron Sabadu. Ida nee kontra ita nia lei!”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Jesus hatete ba sira, “Imi lee tiha ona liurai David nia istoria. Nusaa mak imi la kompriende nafatin? Iha loron ida David ho nia ema sira hamlaha loos i presiza hahaan. <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Nia tama ba tenda orasaun. Iha nebaa iha paun nebee nai lulik sira oferese ona ba Maromak. Tuir lo-loos, so nai lulik sira deit mak bele haan paun nee, ema seluk la bele. Maibee David foti tiha paun nee hodi haan, i nia fahe mos ba nia ema sira haan. Ida nee akontese iha nai lulik boot Abiatar nia tempu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Samuel 21:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:9">Levítiku 24:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Jesus hatutan tan dehan, “Maromak halo loron Sabadu atu ajuda ema, laos atu foo todan ba ema. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Nee duni Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan mak loron Sabadu nia Nain. Hau mak iha direitu atu desidi, ema bele halo saida iha loron nee.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema liman sorin mate iha loron Sabadu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateus 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Lucas 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Iha loron Sabadu ida, Jesus baa tama fali iha uma kreda. Iha nebaa iha mane ida nia liman sorin mate. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ema Farizeu balu buka hela dalan atu foo sala ba Jesus. Entaun sira haree tu-tuir Nia atu kura ema nee iha loron sabadu ka lae.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jesus bolu ema liman sorin mate nee hodi dehan, “Mai hamriik iha nee.”<verse eid="MRK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Depois Nia husu ba ema sira nee, “Tuir ita nia lei relijiaun, ita bele halo saida iha loron Sabadu? Ita bele halo buat diak ka, aat? Ita bele salva ema ka, oho ema?” Maibee sira hotu nonook deit.<verse eid="MRK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Jesus hateke ba sira ida-ida ho hirus. Nia mos laran susar teb-tebes tanba sira ulun toos. Depois Nia dehan ba ema liman sorin mate nee, “Lolo o nia liman mate nee mai!” Ema nee lolo ba, i nia liman diak kedas.<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Haree nunee, ema Farizeu sira sai tiha husi uma kreda. I sira komesa kombina malu ho partidu Herodes nia membru sira, oinsaa mak bele oho Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema barak iha tasi ibun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira husik tiha fatin nee hodi baa fali tasi Galileia, i ema barak lao tuir sira. Ema sira nee mai husi provinsia Galileia <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />ho Judeia. Iha balu mai husi sidade Jerusalém, husi Idumeia, husi mota Jordaun nia sorin ba, ho mos husi sidade Tiru ho Sidon. Ema sira nee mai tanba sira rona kona ba buat hotu nebee Jesus halo. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Tanba ema barak tebes, entaun Jesus haruka Nia eskolante sira prepara roo ida atu Nia bele tuur iha laran para ema lubun boot nee la bele sena malu ho nia. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Nia kura tiha ona ema moras barak, nee mak ema moras sira seluk mai hadau malu atu kona Nia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Marcos 4:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lucas 5:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Iha ema balu espiritu aat tama iha sira nia laran. Bainhira sira haree Jesus, ema sira nee monu ba rai hodi hakilar dehan, “O nee Maromak nia Oan!” <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Maibee Jesus bandu makaas atu la bele foo sai katak Nia nee see.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus hili Nia apostolu sanulu resin rua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateus 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Lucas 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Iha loron ida Jesus sae ba foho ida. Iha nebaa Nia bolu ema balu hakbesik ba Nia, i sira mos baa. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Depois Nia hili nain sanulu resin rua sai Nia apostolu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos husi tempu antigu barak. Balu hakerek “sai Nia apostolu”, balu lae.</char></note> Nia foti sira atu sira akompanha Nia, i atu haruka sira baa foo sai Liafuan Diak. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Nia mos foo kbiit ba sira atu bele duni sai diabu husi ema.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Sira nain sanulu resin rua nebee Nia hili nee, sira nia naran mak hanesan tuir mai nee:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:16">Simão (Jesus mos bolu nia Pedro),<verse eid="MRK 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Tiago ho João (sira nain rua Zebedeu nia oan. Jesus bolu sira Boanerjes, nee katak “hanesan rai tarutu”),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iha nee Marcos hakerek dehan, “rai tarutu nia oan”. Nee katak, sira nia hahalok hanesan rai tarutu. Matenek nain Biblia nian balu hanoin dehan, Tiago ho João sira nia lian makaas hanesan rai tarutu, bele mos sira gosta koalia ho hirus.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />André,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Filipe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Bartolomeu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Mateus,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Tomé,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Tiago (Alfeu nia oan),</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Tadeu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 3:18">Simão (nia ema Patriota),<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Patriota sira buka dalan para ema Judeu sira bele sai husi estadu Roma nia okos hodi ukun aan. Ema mos bolu sira Zelote.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />ho Judas Iscariotes (ikus mai nia mak faan Jesus).<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus nunka uza Satanás nia kbiit</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateus 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Lucas 11:14-23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Hotu tiha Jesus tuun fali husi foho hodi baa tama iha uma ida. Ema barak mai hobur hamutuk iha fatin nee, too Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira atu haan mos la bele. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Bainhira Nia familia sira rona nunee, sira mai atu lori Nia sai tiha, tanba ema dehan, “Nia bulak tiha ona!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Iha mestri relijiaun balu mai husi Jerusalém, sira dehan, “Diabu nia xefi Belzebu tama ona Nia laran. Belzebu nee mak foo kbiit ba Nia hodi duni sai diabu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mateus 9:34</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Rona nunee, Jesus bolu ema sira nee mai hodi hatete ba sira uza komparasaun dehan, “Oinsaa mak Satanás bele duni sai Satanás? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Se iha nasaun ida, nia povu haan malu hela deit, nasaun nee sei monu. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Se iha uma kain ida, nia ema sira istori malu hela deit, sira sei naksobu. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Se Satanás kontra nia aan rasik, i diabu sira haan malu hela deit, entaun Satanás la bele hamriik metin, i nia ukun sei la dura.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Hau foo ezemplu tan. Se ema ida hakarak tama baa foti sasaan husi ema forti ida nia uma, nia tenki futu metin tiha ema forti nee uluk mak foin bele lalin sasaan sai husi nia uma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nunee Jesus dehan katak, Nia mak forsa liu diabu nia xefi, ida nebee sira bolu “Belzebu”.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, sala saida deit mak ema halo, Maromak foo perdaun, too ema hatete aat Maromak mos Maromak sei foo perdaun. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Maibee see mak hatete aat Espiritu Santu, Maromak sei la foo perdaun ba nia. Ema nee sei lori nia sala nee too tinan ba tinan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Lucas 12:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Jesus hatete nunee tanba sira dehan, “Ema nee, espiritu aat tama tiha ona Nia laran.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">See mak Nai Jesus nia familia lo-loos</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateus 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Lucas 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Depois Jesus nia inan ho Nia alin mane sira too mai. Sira hamriik iha liur hodi haruka ema tama baa bolu Nia. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Iha uma laran, ema barak tuur haleu hela Jesus, sira dehan ba Nia, “Ita Boot nia inan ho alin sira iha liur hela, sira husu atu hasoru malu ho Ita Boot.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jesus hataan, “Hau nia inan mak see? I Hau nia alin sira mak see?”<verse eid="MRK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Depois Nia hateke ba ema nebee tuur haleu Nia nee hodi dehan, “Imi sira nee mak Hau nia inan ho Hau nia alin sira. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />See mak halo tuir Maromak nia hakarak, sira nee mak Hau nia inan, Hau nia feton ho Hau nia alin mane sira.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Komparasaun kona ba ema nebee kari fini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateus 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Lucas 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Iha loron ida Jesus komesa hanorin iha tasi ibun Galileia. Ema barak teb-tebes mai haleu Nia, nunee Nia baa tuur iha roo ida nebee para hela iha tasi ninin, i ema barak nee hamriik deit iha tasi ibun.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Lucas 5:1-3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Nia hanorin buat barak uza komparasaun. Nia dehan nunee: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Rona mai! Iha toos nain ida baa kari fini iha nia toos. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Bainhira nia kari fini nee, balu monu iha dalan. I manu fuik mai haan tiha hotu. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Fini balu monu iha fatuk leten, fini nee moris lalais deit tanba rai mihis. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Bainhira loro matan sae, loro manas sunu fini nebee foin moris sai mai nee too namlaik tiha, tanba abut la tama iha rai okos. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Fini balu monu iha duut tarak laran. Fini nee moris, maibee duut tarak habit tiha too la foo isin. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Iha tan fini balu monu iha rai bokur. Fini nee moris diak, buras, too foo isin barak, balu too musan tolu-nulu, balu too musan neen-nulu i balu too musan atus ida.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Jesus hatutan tan dehan, “Imi nebee iha tilun, rona di-diak ba!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tanba saa mak Nai Jesus hanorin uza komparasaun?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateus 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Lucas 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Bainhira Jesus mesak ho Nia eskolante sanulu resin rua ho ema balu tan nebee baibain tuir Nia, sira husu ba Nia kona ba komparasaun hirak nee. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Jesus dehan ba sira, “Uluk ema seidauk hatene, oinsaa mak Maromak ukun nudar Liurai. Agora Hau foo sai mo-moos ba imi deit, maibee ba ema seluk Hau sempre uza komparasaun, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />atu nunee</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‘Sira haree duni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">maibee la kompriende saida mak sira haree.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Sira rona hela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">maibee la kompriende saida mak sira rona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Nunee sira la bele fila fali ba Maromak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">atu Nia hamoos sira nia sala.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isaias 6:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komparasaun kona ba kari fini dehan saida?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateus 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Lucas 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Depois Jesus dehan tan, “Imi la kompriende komparasaun nee ka? Se imi la kompriende ida nee, entaun komparasaun sira seluk imi atu kompriende oinsaa? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Komparasaun nee nunee: Toos nain nebee kari fini nee mak ema nebee foo sai Maromak nia liafuan. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Fini nebee monu iha dalan mak ema nebee rona Maromak nia liafuan. Rona hotu tiha, Satanás mai hadau kedas liafuan nebee iha tiha ona sira nia laran. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Fini nebee monu iha fatuk leten mak ema nebee rona Maromak nia liafuan, i simu kedas ho laran haksolok. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Maibee liafuan nee la iha abut. Nunee sira fiar duni maibee la kleur ida. Depois susar kona sira, ka ema seluk halo terus sira tanba sira simu liafuan nee, sira husik tiha kedas. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Fini nebee monu iha duut tarak laran mak ema nebee rona Maromak nia liafuan, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />maibee sira preokupa ho sira nia moris loro-loron nian, sira nia matan naklosu ba riku-soin mundu nian, i sira nia laran nakonu ho hakarak oi-oin deit. Sira nia preokupasaun nee la foo fatin ba Maromak nia liafuan, nunee liafuan nee la muda sira nia moris. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Maibee fini nebee monu iha rai bokur mak ema nebee rona Maromak nia liafuan hodi simu. Depois sira moris tuir, hanesan fini nebee moris too foo isin, balu musan tolu-nulu, balu musan neen-nulu, i balu too musan atus ida.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rona ho atensaun para bele kompriende</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Lucas 8:16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Jesus foo tan komparasaun ida nunee: “Bainhira ema sunu ahi-oan, sira taka tiha ho sanan ka tau fali iha kama okos ka? Lae! Ahi-oan tenki tau iha fatin aas. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateus 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Lucas 11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Nunee mos, buat hotu-hotu nebee agora sei subar hela, iha loron ida sei hatudu mo-moos. I buat hotu-hotu nebee agora taka hela, iha loron ida sei nakloke para ema bele hatene.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mateus 10:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Lucas 12:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />See mak iha tilun, rona di-diak ba!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Depois Jesus hatutan tan dehan, “Hanoin di-diak buat nebee mak imi rona. Se imi hakaas aan hodi kompriende Hau nia liafuan, Maromak sei tulun imi atu kompriende tuir imi nia esforsu nee. Laos nee deit, maibee Maromak sei foo liu fali imi nia esforsu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Versikulu ida nee, ita bele kompriende mos hanesan nee: “Hanoin di-diak buat nebee mak imi rona. Imi tetu ema seluk nia sala oinsaa, Maromak mos sei tetu imi nunee. I sasukat nebee mak imi uza ba ema seluk, Maromak sei uza fali sasukat nee ba imi. ”</char></note> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mateus 7:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Lucas 6:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Tanba ema nebee kompriende ona, Maromak sei halo nia kompriende liu tan. Maibee ema nebee lakohi hatene, buat uitoan nebee nia kompriende tiha ona mos, Maromak sei hasai tiha husi nia hanoin.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mateus 13:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Lucas 19:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komparasaun kona ba fini nebee mesak moris</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jesus halo tan komparasaun dehan, “Maromak ukun nudar Liurai, nee hanesan toos nain kuda fini iha nia toos laran. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Kalan nia deskansa loron nia hadeer fali. Tempu lao dadauk, fini nee moris too buras ba beibeik, maibee toos nain la kompriende oinsaa mak fini nee bele buras hanesan nee. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Rai nee rasik mak halo moris, primeiru iha kain, depois iha funan mak foin iha isin. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Bainhira tasak ona, toos nain mai silu tanba tempu ona.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:13">Joel 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Komparasaun kona ba ai musan nebee kiikoan liu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateus 13:31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Lucas 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Jesus dehan tan, “Maromak ukun Nia reinu, oinsaa loos? Hau atu halo komparasaun ho saida? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Nee hanesan ai musan kiikoan loos nebee mak ema kuda iha toos. Maski ai musan nee kiik liu musan sira seluk iha mundu nee, <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />maibee nia moris i buras too sai ai huun ida nebee mak boot liu iha toos laran, nia sanak mos boot. Nunee manu fuik sira bele mai hamahon aan hodi halo knuuk iha nebaa.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Jesus uza beibeik komparasaun hanesan nee hodi hanorin Maromak nia liafuan ba ema lubun boot. Nia hanorin tuir saida mak sira bele kompriende. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Nia sempre hanorin sira uza komparasaun. Maibee bainhira Nia ho Nia eskolante sira mesak ona, Nia esplika mo-moos ba sira.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus halo anin boot hakmatek</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateus 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Lucas 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Iha loron nee, loro matan besik monu ona, Jesus hatete ba Nia eskolante sira, “Mai ita baa iha tasi sorin.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Nunee sira husik hela ema barak nee hodi lao, sira sae roo nebee mak ohin Jesus tuur hodi hanorin nee. Iha mos roo seluk tuir sira. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37-38" />Jesus tau ulun iha sumasu hodi toba dukur iha roo nia kotuk. La kleur anin boot mosu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:37-38: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tasi Galileia nia naruk kilometru 19, i nia luan kilometru 12. Bainhira anin boot huu, laloran mos boot.</char></note> I laloran baku roo nee halo tasi been tama ba roo laran too bee besik nakonu. Haree nunee, Jesus nia eskolante sira fanu Nia hodi dehan, “Mestri, Ita atu mate ona! Mestri la interese ka?”<verse eid="MRK 4:37-38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Jesus hadeer hodi siak anin i hatete ba laloran nunee: “Para ona! Hakmatek ba!” Anin para kedas, tasi mos hakmatek liu. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Depois Jesus hatete ba sira, “Nusaa mak imi tauk hanesan nee?! Imi la fiar Hau ka?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Nia eskolante sira tauk teb-tebes hodi dehan ba malu, “Ema nee see loos mak too anin ho laloran mos rona Nia?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus duni sai espiritu aat barak husi ema ida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateus 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Lucas 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira ho roo too rai Gerasa, iha tasi Galileia nia sorin ba. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Iha nebaa iha mane ida, espiritu aat tama iha nia laran. Bainhira Jesus tuun husi roo, ema nee lao sai mai husi rate atu hasoru Nia. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ema nee hela deit iha rate, i la iha tan ema ida mak bele kesi nia, maski ho korenti besi mos la bele. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Dala barak ona ema kesi nia liman-ain ho korenti besi, maibee nia sempre rasta kotu tiha korenti iha nia liman, i korenti iha nia ain mos nia halo rahun hotu. Nia forti liu, too la iha ema ida bele kaer metin. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Loron-kalan nia lao ba-mai iha rate leet ho mos lao tuun-sae foho hodi hakilar beibeik i tuku kanek nia aan ho fatuk.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Bainhira ema nee haree Jesus husi dook, nia halai ba iha Jesus hodi hakruuk too rai iha Jesus nia oin. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7-8" />Jesus haruka espiritu aat nee dehan “Espiritu aat, sai husi ema nee!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:7-8">Ema nee hakilar ho lian makaas dehan, “Jesus, Maromak Aas Liu nia Oan, O hakarak halo saida mai hau? Hau husu O atu jura hodi Maromak nia naran katak O sei la kastigu hau.”<verse eid="MRK 5:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jesus husu ba nia, “O naran saa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Ema nee hataan, “Hau nia naran Batalhaun, tanba ami barak.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Depois nia husu beibeik ba Jesus atu la bele duni sai espiritu aat sira nee sai husi rai nee.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Iha momentu nebaa, iha fahi barak teb-tebes haan hela iha foho lolon, la dook husi fatin nee. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Espiritu aat sira husu fila-fila ba Jesus dehan, “Haruka ami baa tama iha fahi sira nebaa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Jesus mos foo lisensa. Entaun espiritu aat sira sai husi ema nee baa tama fali iha fahi sira. I fahi sira nee halai saruntu malu tuun husi foho lolon nee hodi monu hotu ba tasi laran. Nunee fahi sira nee mout too mate hotu. Fahi nebee mate nee hamutuk maizoumenus rihun rua.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Hotu tiha fahi atan sira halai baa konta sai iha sidade ho fatin sira nebee besik. I ema barak mai atu haree saida mak akontese tiha ona. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Too iha nebaa, sira haree ema nebee uluk espiritu aat batalhaun ida hela iha nia laran nee, diak tiha ona. Nia tuur hakmatek hela, hatais tiha ona hena, i hanoin normal fali ona. Haree nunee, sira hotu tauk. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ema sira nebee ohin haree Jesus duni sai diabu nee, sira konta ba sira nebee foin mai, kona ba oinsaa mak Jesus kura ema nee, i saida mak akontese ba fahi sira nee. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Depois ema iha rai nee husu fila-fila atu Jesus sai tiha husi sira nia rain.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Bainhira Jesus atu sae fali ba roo laran, ema nebee ohin espiritu aat sai husi nia nee, husu atu bele baa hamutuk ho Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Maibee Jesus lakohi. Nia dehan, “Diak liu o fila ba o nia maluk sira hodi konta saida mak Nai Maromak halo ona ba o, i oinsaa Nai Maromak hatudu Nia laran luak ba o.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Entaun ema nee baa lao lemo-lemo iha rai Dekápolis hodi konta sai kona ba buat hotu nebee Jesus halo ba nia. Ema nebee rona, sira hotu admira.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus halo moris menina ida, i kura feto ida tan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateus 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Lucas 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jesus ho roo fila fali ba tasi sorin. Nia foin too iha tasi ninin, ema barak teb-tebes mai hobur Nia. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Iha ema ida naran Jairo, nia responsavel ida iha uma kreda iha sidade nee, nia mos mai. Bainhira nia haree Jesus, nia hakruuk too rai iha Jesus nia oin <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />hodi husu tulun dehan, “Hau nia oan feto besik atu mate. Hau husu atu Ita Boot baa tau liman ba labarik nee para nia bele diak fali i bele moris.” <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Nunee Jesus baa ho Jairo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:24">Sira lao dadauk, ema barak lao tuir Jesus too sena malu kona Nia. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Iha ema lubun boot nee, iha feto ida, nia fulan mai la para durante tinan sanulu resin rua. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Nia gasta tiha ona nia riku-soin hotu hodi baa konsulta iha doutor, maibee doutor sira la bele kura nia moras. Tratamentu nebee sira foo nee halo nia terus liu, i nia moras aumenta tan deit. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Feto nee rona ona kona ba Jesus. Nunee nia sena malu husi ema barak nia leet hodi baa bes-besik iha Jesus nia kotuk, nia kona Jesus nia hena. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Tanba nia hanoin nunee: “Naran katak hau kona kois deit Nia hena mos, hau nia moras sei diak.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Nia foin kona Jesus nia hena, nia raan para kedas, i nia senti nia moras nee diak fali ona. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Iha momentu nee kedas Jesus senti iha kbiit sai husi Nia. Nunee Nia hateke ba kotuk hodi haree ba ema barak nee, i Nia husu, “See mak ohin kona Hau nia hena nee?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Nia eskolante sira hataan, “Ita Boot rasik haree deit ba, iha ema barak mak sena malu kona Ita Boot. Halo nusaa mak Ita Boot husu fali, ‘See mak ohin kona Hau nia hena?!’”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Maibee Jesus haree ba-mai atu buka hatene see loos mak ohin kona Nia hena nee. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Feto nebee ohin kona Jesus nia hena nee, tauk teb-tebes ho nakdedar, tanba nia hatene saida mak ohin akontese ba nia. Nunee nia baa hakneak hakruuk too rai iha Jesus nia ain hodi konta sai hotu.<verse eid="MRK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Depois Jesus dehan, “Hau nia oan, o hetan kura tanba o fiar mai Hau. O nia moras nee kura hotu tiha ona. Fila ho laran hakmatek.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Jesus sei koalia hela, ema balu mai husi Jairo nia uma foo hatene ba Jairo dehan, “Senhor nia oan iis kotu tiha ona. Ita halo kole tan mestri hodi halo saida?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Rona nunee Jesus hatete ba Jairo, “Lalika tauk. Fiar deit.”<verse eid="MRK 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Jesus lori deit Pedro, Tiago ho Tiago nia alin João hodi akompanha Jairo. Ema sira seluk Nia bandu la bele tuir. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bainhira sira too iha Jairo nia uma, Jesus haree ema barak rungu-ranga, i ema tanis lelir. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Jesus tama ba iha uma laran. Depois Nia dehan ba sira, “Nusaa mak imi rungu-ranga hodi tanis lelir hanesan nee? Labarik nee la mate ida, nia toba deit.” <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Maibee sira hamnasa fali Nia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:40">Jesus haruka sira hotu sai. Depois Nia bolu labarik nee nia inan-aman ho Nia eskolante nain tolu nee, para sira tama hamutuk iha labarik nee nia kuartu laran. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Depois Jesus kaer labarik nee nia liman hodi dehan ba nia, “<char style="it">Talita kum!</char>” Nee dehan katak, “Noi, Hau haruka o hadeer ona!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Derepenti deit labarik feto nee hadeer, i lao kedas. Haree nunee, sira hotu admira teb-tebes. Labarik nee tinan sanulu resin rua.<verse eid="MRK 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Jesus bandu sira la bele konta sai ba ema seluk. I nia haruka sira foo hahaan ba labarik nee.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Ema Nazaré lakohi simu Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateus 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Lucas 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Jesus husik tiha fatin nee hodi baa fali iha Nia aldeia rasik, i Nia eskolante sira mos baa hotu. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Too ona loron Sabadu, Jesus tama ba iha uma kreda hodi hanorin. Ema nebee rona, barak mak admira hodi husu ba malu, “Ema nee hetan buat sira nee husi nebee? Oinsaa mak Nia bele hetan matenek hanesan nee? Nia kbiit mai husi nebee mak Nia bele halo milagre? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ita hatene hela Nia. Nia nee badaen ai ida. Nia inan mak Maria, i nia alin sira Tiago, José, Judas ho Simão. Nia alin feto sira mos hela iha nee.” Nunee sira laran moras too lakohi simu Nia.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Jesus hatete ba sira, “Ema iha nebee-nebee deit respeita Maromak nia profeta. So ema husi nia aldeia rasik ho nia maluk rasik ho nia familia rasik mak la respeita nia.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">João 4:44</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6a" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5-6a" />Ema sira nee lakohi fiar ba Jesus. Nee mak Nia la bele halo milagre barak iha sira nia leet, Nia so tau liman ba ema moras balu deit hodi kura sira. Nia hakfodak tanba ema iha nebaa la fiar ba Nia.<verse eid="MRK 6:5-6a" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus foo knaar ba Nia eskolante sira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateus 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Lucas 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6b" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6b" />Hotu tiha Jesus lao husi aldeia ida ba aldeia seluk hodi hanorin Maromak nia liafuan. <verse eid="MRK 6:6b" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Nia bolu Nia eskolante nain sanulu resin rua i haruka sira lao ru-rua hodi foo kbiit ba sira atu duni sai espiritu aat. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Nia haruka sira nunee: “Bainhira imi lao, lori ai tonka. La bele lori pasta, bukae ka osan iha bolsu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Tau sandalias, maibee keta lori hena hodi troka.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Nia hatutan tan, “Kuandu ema simu imi iha sira nia uma, hela deit iha uma nee too imi sai fali husi aldeia nee. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Se imi baa too iha fatin ida mak ema la simu imi ka la rona imi nia liafuan, husik tiha fatin nee, i hisik rai rahun husi imi nia ain okos nudar sinal katak sira rasik mak sei lori todan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Lucas 10:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 13:51</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Nunee eskolante sira lao ba iha fat-fatin hodi foo sai katak ema tenki hakribi sira nia sala. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Sira duni sai diabu barak husi ema, i kose mina ba ema moras barak hodi kura sira.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Tiago 5:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Liurai Herodes haruka tesi João Sarani Nain nia kakorok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateus 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Lucas 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Iha tempu nee, ema barak temi ona Jesus nia naran. Liurai Herodes mos rona kona ba saida mak Jesus halo. Balu dehan, “Ema nee João Sarani Nain mak moris fali ona husi mate. Nee mak Nia iha kbiit hodi halo milagre.” <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Balu tan dehan, “Nia nee profeta Elias.” Seluk tan dehan, “Nia nee Maromak nia profeta ida, hanesan mos profeta sira iha tempu antigu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mateus 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Marcos 8:28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Lucas 9:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Rona nunee Herodes dehan, “João ida hau tesi nia kakorok nee mak moris fali ona husi mate.”<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17-18" />João Sarani Nain ho Herodes nia istoria nunee: Uluk Herodes hola fali nia alin Filipe nia kaben, naran Herodias. Iha tempu nebaa João hasee nia fila-fila dehan, “Ita la bele hola fali ita nia alin nia kaben, hahalok nee kontra Maromak nia lei!” Tanba nee, Herodes haruka ema kaer João i futu nia hodi hatama ba iha komarka.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Lucas 3:19-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 6:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Nunee Herodias rai odi ba João, i hakarak atu oho. Maibee nia la bele oho, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />tanba Herodes respeita João i defende nia. Herodes hatene katak João nee ema ida nebee moris loos, i Maromak mak haruka nia mai. Bainhira Herodes rona João koalia, nia laran la hakmatek. Maski nunee, nia gosta rona.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Too ikus Herodias hetan oportunidade atu halakon João, iha tempu nebee Herodes halo tinan. Iha loron nee nia halo festa boot. Nia konvida nia funsionariu bo-boot, komandante militar ho mos ema boot sira iha Galileia laran. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Festa too klaran ona, Herodias nia oan feto tama mai dansa iha bainaka sira nia oin. Menina nee nia dansa halo Herodes ho bainaka sira nia laran kontenti teb-tebes. Liurai Herodes hatete ba menina nee, “O hakarak husu saida deit, husu ba! Hau sei foo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Nia jura ba menina nee dehan, “Saida deit mak o husu mai hau, hau sei foo ba o. Se o hakarak ukun hau nia rai sorin balu mos hau sei foo ba o.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Menina nee sai baa husu nia inan nunee, “Hau husu saida mak diak?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Nia inan hataan, “O baa husu João Sarani Nain nia ulun.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Menina nee halai kedas ba iha liurai Herodes hodi husu, “Hau hakarak João Sarani Nain nia ulun, tau iha bandeja ida, entrega kedas mai hau.”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Liurai laran susar teb-tebes. Maibee nia jura tiha ona iha bainaka sira nia oin, entaun nia tenki halo tuir. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Nia haruka kedas nia soldadu ida baa hasai João nia ulun atu lori mai. Soldadu nee mos baa iha komarka hodi tesi João nia kakorok, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />i tau nia ulun iha bandeja lori baa foo ba menina nee. Depois menina nee lori baa foo ba nia inan.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Bainhira João nia eskolante sira rona dehan ema oho tiha João, sira baa lori sai João nia mate isin baa haloot iha rate.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus foo hahaan ba ema rihun lima resin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateus 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lucas 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">João 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Iha loron ida, Jesus nia apostolu sira nebee uluk Nia haruka baa nee, sira fila fali mai hamutuk ho Nia. Sira konta ba Nia buat hotu-hotu nebee mak sira halo ona, ho buat nebee mak sira hanorin ona. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Iha tempu nee ema barak lao ba lao mai, halo Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira haan mos la bele. Entaun Jesus hatete ba Nia eskolante sira, “Mai ita baa iha fatin ida hakmatek hodi deskansa.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Nunee Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira sae roo hodi baa iha rai fuik ida.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Maibee ema barak haree hela roo nee lao, i hatene see mak iha laran. Nunee ema husi aldeia hotu-hotu halai liu husi tasi ibun. I ema sira nee mak too uluk. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Bainhira Jesus tuun husi roo, i haree ema barak nee, Nia hanoin loos sira, tanba sira hanesan bibi malae nebee la iha bibi atan atu hatudu dalan ba sira. Entaun Nia komesa hanorin sira buat barak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Númerus 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1 Liurai 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2 Krónikas 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezequiel 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Zacarias 10:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mateus 9:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Bainhira lokraik ona, Jesus nia eskolante sira mai hatete ba Nia dehan, “Iha nee rai fuik, rai mos atu kalan ona. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Diak liu haruka ema sira nee baa iha aldeia sira nebee besik hodi sosa hahaan rasik.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Maibee Jesus hataan, “Imi mak foo hahaan ba sira.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Nia eskolante sira hataan fali, “Ami mak atu hola hahaan ba sira hotu ka? Se nunee ita tenki gasta osan barak teb-tebes, hanesan ema badaen nia salariu fulan walu nian!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iha nee Marcos hakerek </char><char style="it">“denáriu</char> atus rua”. Iha tempu nebaa badaen sira loron ida manaan <char style="it">denáriu</char> ida.</note><verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jesus husu, “Imi iha paun fuan hira? Baa haree took!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Nunee sira baa buka hatene, depois sira mai fali dehan, “Iha paun fuan lima ho ikan rua.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Jesus haruka Nia eskolante sira baa foo hatene ema barak nee tuur tuir grupu iha duut matak leten. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Entaun sira tuur tuir grupu, grupu balu ema atus ida, balu lima-nulu.<verse eid="MRK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Nia foti paun fuan lima ho ikan rua nee, i hateke ba lalehan hodi foo agradese ba Maromak. Nia silu paun halo rohan-rohan, i foo ba Nia eskolante sira. Depois Nia eskolante sira hodi baa fahe ba ema lubun boot nee. Ikan rua mos Nia halo pedasuk-pedasuk, depois fahe ba sira. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Sira hotu haan too bosu, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />hahaan mos resin. Nia eskolante sira tau hamutuk hahaan restu sira nee iha bote sanulu resin rua nakonu. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Ema nebee haan nee rihun lima. Nee foin sura mane deit, feto ho labarik la sura.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus lao iha bee leten</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mateus 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">João 6:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Hotu tiha, Jesus haruka kedas Nia eskolante sira sae roo hodi baa uluk iha aldeia Betsaida iha tasi sorin. Maibee Nia sei hela iha nebaa atu haruka ema lubun boot nee fila. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Depois Jesus mesak sae ba foho ida hodi halo orasaun.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Rai kalan ona, roo nebee mak eskolante sira sae nee too tiha ona tasi klaran, i Jesus mesak iha rai maran. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Nia haree Nia eskolante sira hean roo makaas teb-tebes maibee roo la lao ba oin tanba halai hasoru anin boot. Iha dadeer-saan nakukun, Jesus lao iha bee leten ba iha Nia eskolante sira. Nia atu lao liu ona, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />maibee bainhira Nia eskolante sira haree Nia lao iha bee leten, sira hanoin dehan mate klamar. Nunee sira hakilar <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />tanba sira hotu haree Nia i sira tauk teb-tebes.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Jesus hatete kedas ba sira, “Brani ba! Nee Hau. La bele tauk!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Depois Nia tama iha roo laran hamutuk ho sira, i anin mos para kedas. Eskolante sira hakfodak loos. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Maski Jesus halo milagre hodi foo haan ema rihun lima resin, maibee eskolante sira la kompriende nafatin kona ba Jesus nia kbiit, tanba sira nia ulun toos.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema moras iha Genesaré</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateus 14:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Bainhira Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira too iha tasi sorin, iha rai Genesaré, sira kesi sira nia roo iha nebaa. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Sira foin tuun husi roo, ema barak konhese kedas Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Nunee ema sira nee halai baa foo hatene ema iha rejiaun nee tomak. Ema rona dehan Jesus iha nebee, sira hulan moras sira ba iha nebaa. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Jesus baa iha aldeia ida ka sidade ka rejiaun nebee deit, ema lori sira nia maluk nebee mak moras hodi tau iha fatin publiku. Sira husu ba Jesus atu ema moras sira nee bele kona deit Nia hena rohan. Ema moras sira nebee konsege kona Nia hena rohan, sira hetan kura hotu.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Keta troka Nai Maromak nia lei ho ita nia lisan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateus 15:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Iha loron ida ema balu husi grupu Farizeu ho mestri relijiaun balu mai husi Jerusalém atu hasoru malu ho Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Sira haree Jesus nia eskolante balu haan la fase liman tuir bei-ala sira nia kostumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ema Judeu hotu-hotu, liu-liu sira husi grupu Farizeu, kaer metin sira nia bei-ala nia kostumi oinsaa fase liman molok haan. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Bainhira fila husi merkadu, antes atu haan sira tenki fase liman tuir sira nia lisan. Iha tan regra seluk mak sira halo tuir, hanesan fase kopu, buli ho mos sanan.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Entaun ema Farizeu sira ho mestri relijiaun sira husu Jesus dehan, “Tansaa mak Ita Boot nia eskolante sira la moris tuir ita nia bei-ala sira nia lisan? Nusaa mak sira haan la fase liman?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Jesus hataan, “Imi koalia oin seluk, hahalok oin seluk! Buat nebee hori uluk kedas profeta Isaias hakerek, kona loos imi. Nia foo tutan Maromak nia liafuan nunee:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Ema sira nee hahii Hau ho ibun tutun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">maibee sira nia laran dook husi Hau.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Sira adora Hau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">maibee la iha folin.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">Sira hanorin deit lei ema nian,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">maibee bosok fali dehan, sira nia hanorin nee mai husi Hau.’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Isaias 29:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Imi husik tiha ona Maromak nia ukun fuan hodi kaer metin fali lisan nebee mai husi ema.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Nia hatutan tan dehan, “Imi fasil loos tau Maromak nia ukun fuan iha imi nia kotuk para imi bele halo tuir imi nia lisan rasik. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Tanba Moisés dehan, ‘Respeita o nia inan-aman.’ Nia mos dehan, ‘See mak koalia liafuan aat hasoru nia inan-aman, ema nee sei hetan kastigu mate.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Ézodu 20:12</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Levítiku 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Deuteronómiu 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Maibee imi hanorin oin seluk fali. Tuir imi, ema bele hatete ba nia inan-aman dehan, ‘Sasaan nebee apaa ho amaa presiza, hau la bele foo, tanba hau promete ona atu foo ba Maromak.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Nunee imi bandu ema atu la bele ajuda sira nia inan-aman ona. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Liu husi lisan nebee mak imi hanorin nee, imi halakon tiha Maromak nia lei. Iha buat barak mak imi halo hanesan nee.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buat aat iha ema nia laran mak halo nia foer</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateus 15:10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Depois Jesus bolu tan ema hotu iha nebaa atu mai besik. Nia dehan ba sira, “Imi hotu-hotu rona mai, i kompriende di-diak Hau nia liafuan nee. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Buat nebee mak tama ba ema nia laran, nee la halo foer nia iha Maromak nia oin. Maibee buat nebee mak sai husi ema nia laran, nee mak halo foer nia. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[See mak iha tilun, rona di-diak ba!]”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Versikulu 16 nee tama iha kopia nee balu, maibee iha kopia nebee antigu liu la tama.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Hanorin hotu tiha Jesus husik ema barak nee hodi tama ba iha uma ida. Depois Nia eskolante sira husu kona ba komparasaun nebee ohin Nia koalia nee.<verse eid="MRK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Jesus hataan ba sira, “Entaun imi la kompriende nafatin ka? Imi hatene katak, buat nebee tama iha ema nia isin liu husi nia ibun nee la halo foer nia. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Tanba buat nebee ema haan, laos tama ba iha nia fuan laran, maibee hahaan nee tama ba iha nia kabun laran, depois sai fali.” Ho nunee Jesus hatete katak, hahaan saida deit ema bele haan, la bandu ida.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Jesus hatutan tan dehan, “Saida mak sai husi ema nia laran, ida nee mak halo foer nia. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21-22" />Tanba hanoin aat nebee mosu husi ema nia laran mak lori nia ba halo sala ho ema nia feen ka laen, halo sala seksual sel-seluk, naok, oho ema, kaan ema nia sasaan, halo buat aat, han-matak ema nia sasaan, la hatene moe, laran moras ema, hatete aat ema seluk, foti aan, i ulun toos. <verse eid="MRK 7:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Hahalok sira nee hotu sai husi ema nia laran, nee mak halo ema foer iha Maromak nia oin.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Feto jentiu ida fiar makaas ba Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateus 15:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Hotu tiha Jesus sai husi fatin nee hodi baa iha rai ida besik sidade Tiru.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos husi tempu antigu barak. Balu hakerek “Tiru”, balu hakerek “Tiru ho Sidon”.</char></note> Iha nebaa Nia tama iha uma ida. Nia lakohi atu ema seluk hatene katak Nia iha fatin nee, maibee Nia atu subar Aan la diak.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Iha fatin nee iha senhora ida, nia oan feto espiritu aat tama iha laran. Bainhira senhora nee rona katak Jesus iha hela fatin nee, nia mai kedas hakneak hakruuk too rai iha Jesus nia oin. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Senhora nee ema jentiu ida, laos Judeu, nia moris iha rai Fenísia iha provinsia Síria. Nia husu fila-fila ba Jesus atu duni sai espiritu aat husi nia oan.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jesus soe lia dehan, “Husik labarik sira haan lai too bosu mak foin foo restu ba asu. La bele foti labarik nia hahaan hodi soe fali ba asu. Nee la loos.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:27: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iha nee labarik hatudu ba ema Israel i asu hatudu ba ema jentiu.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Maibee senhora nee hataan fali dehan, “Loos duni Nai, maibee asu iha meza okos bele hili labarik nia hahaan nebee mak monu iha rai.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Jesus dehan, “Ita boot hataan ho diak. Entaun bele fila ona ba uma. Diabu sai tiha ona husi ita boot nia oan feto.” <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Senhora nee fila ba uma, nia haree nia oan toba hela, diabu sai tiha ona husi nia.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema ida nebee tilun diuk i koalia la moos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Hotu tiha Jesus sai husi rejiaun Tiru baa fali iha Sidon. Depois Nia baa iha tasi Galileia hodi tama ba iha rai Dekápolis.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekápolis nee katak “sidade sanulu”.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Iha nebaa ema balu mai lori sira nia maluk ida nebee tilun diuk i koalia la moos. Sira lori nia ba iha Jesus hodi husu fila-fila atu Jesus tau liman ba nia.<verse eid="MRK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jesus lori ema nee sees husi ema barak nia klaran. Nia hatama Nia liman fuan ba iha ema nee nia tilun. Depois Nia tafui kabeen ba iha Nia liman hodi tau ba ema nee nia nanaal. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Hotu tiha Nia hateke sae ba lalehan, Nia dada iis naruk hodi dehan ba ema nee, “<char style="it">Efata!</char>” Nee katak “Nakloke ba!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Derepenti ema tilun diuk nee bele rona fali, nia nanaal mos mamar tiha, i nia komesa koalia moos.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jesus bandu ema sira iha nebaa atu la bele hatete sai ba ema ida. Maski Jesus bandu makaas, maibee sira baa konta liu tan. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Sira admira teb-tebes hodi dehan, “Nia halo saida deit, furak teb-tebes. Ema tilun diuk bele rona, ema nebee la hatene koalia bele koalia.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus foo hahaan ba ema rihun haat</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateus 15:32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Iha tempu nebaa, iha tan ema barak mai halibur hamutuk ho Jesus. Sira nia hahaan la iha ona, nunee Jesus bolu Nia eskolante sira hodi dehan, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Hau hanoin loos ema barak nee. Sira hamutuk ho Hau loron tolu ona, i sira nia hahaan la iha ona. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Se Hau haruka sira fila ba sira nia uma ho kabun mamuk deit, sira bele monu iha dalan, tanba sira balu mai husi fatin dook.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Jesus nia eskolante sira hataan, “Rai nee fuik. Ita atu hetan hahaan husi nebee mak atu foo hahaan ba ema sira nee?!”<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Jesus husu ba sira, “Imi iha paun fuan hira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Sira hataan, “Iha hitu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Depois Jesus haruka ema lubun boot nee tuur hotu iha rai. Nia foti paun fuan hitu nee hodi foo agradese ba Maromak. Nia silu halo rohan-rohan tiha foo ba Nia eskolante sira, depois sira fahe ba ema lubun boot nee. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Sira mos iha ikan kiik, uitoan deit. Jesus foo agradese ba Maromak ba ikan nee, i haruka Nia eskolante sira fahe ba ema lubun boot nee. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Sira hotu haan too bosu, hahaan mos resin. Nia eskolante sira tau hamutuk hahaan restu sira nee iha bote hitu nakonu. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Ema nebee haan nee maizoumenus rihun haat. Hotu tiha Jesus haruka ema lubun boot nee fila. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Depois Nia baa sae kedas roo hamutuk ho Nia eskolante sira hodi baa iha rai Dalmanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema Farizeu husu Nai Jesus atu hatudu milagre</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mateus 16:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Ema Farizeu balu mai litik Jesus. Sira hakarak koko Nia, nunee sira husu para Nia halo milagre hodi hatudu katak Nia kbiit nee mai duni husi Maromak ka lae.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mateus 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Lucas 11:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Jesus dada iis naruk hodi dehan, “Tanba saa mak imi ema agora nee husu Hau halo milagre hanesan sinal atu imi bele fiar? Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, Hau sei la halo ba imi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mateus 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Lucas 11:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Depois Jesus husik tiha sira. Nia sae fali roo hodi baa iha tasi sorin.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuidadu ho ema Farizeu ho Herodes sira nia hahalok</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateus 16:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Iha tasi klaran, Jesus nia eskolante sira foin hanoin katak sira haluha lori paun, sira so iha deit paun fuan ida iha roo laran. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Depois Jesus foo hanoin ba sira, “Kuidadu! Hadook aan husi ema Farizeu ho Herodes sira nia fermentu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Lucas 12:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Nia eskolante sira komesa hatete ba malu dehan, “Karik Nia koalia hanesan nee tanba ita la iha paun.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Jesus hatene hela saida mak sira koalia. Entaun Nia hatete, “Nusaa mak imi diskuti malu fali kona ba paun? Imi seidauk kompriende ka? Tuir loos imi hatene ona! Nusaa mak imi ulun toos hanesan nee? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Imi iha matan, maibee imi la haree. Imi iha tilun, maibee imi la rona buat ida. Imi haluha ona ka?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Jeremias 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Ezequiel 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:12">Marcos 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Foin dadauk Hau silu paun fuan lima fahe ba ema rihun lima, imi tau hamutuk hahaan restu too bote hira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Sira hataan, “Bote sanulu resin rua.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Jesus husu tan, “Depois oinsaa ho paun fuan hitu nebee Hau fahe ba ema rihun haat? Imi halibur hamutuk hahaan restu too bote boot hira?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Sira hataan, “Bote boot hitu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Jesus dehan ba sira, “Nee mos imi la kompriende nafatin ka?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura mane matan delek ida iha Betsaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira baa iha aldeia Betsaida. Too iha nebaa ema balu lori ema matan delek ida ba iha Jesus. Sira husu ba Jesus atu tau liman ba ema nee hodi kura nia. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jesus kaer ema matan delek nia liman hodi lori nia sai husi aldeia nee. Nia tafui ba ema nee nia matan, depois tau liman ba nia matan hodi husu, “O haree hetan buat ruma ka lae?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Ema nee hateke ba-mai, depois dehan, “Hau haree hetan ema, maibee hanesan fali ai huun mak lao ba-mai.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Depois Jesus tau Nia liman ba ema nee nia matan dala ida tan. Ema nee koko atu haree, derepenti nia matan diak fali, i bele haree buat hotu-hotu ho moos. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Jesus haruka ema nee fila ba nia uma. Nia dehan, “O bele fila ona, maibee liu husi dalan seluk. La bele tama ba aldeia Betsaida.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pedro rekonhese Nai Jesus mak Mesias</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mateus 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Lucas 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira baa iha aldeia sira nebee besik Sezareia Filipi. Iha dalan klaran, Nia husu ba sira, “Tuir ema konta, Hau nee see?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Sira hataan, “Ema balu dehan, Ita Boot nee João Sarani Nain. Balu tan dehan, profeta Elias. Seluk tan dehan, profeta ida seluk.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:14-15">Marcos 6:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-8">Lucas 9:7-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Jesus husu tan, “Tuir imi rasik, Hau nee see?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pedro hataan, “Ita Boot nee Mesias, Salvador nebee Maromak promete hori uluk kedas atu haruka mai.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68-69">João 6:68-69</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Jesus bandu sira atu la bele konta sai ba ema ida.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus foo sai katak Nia sei mate i moris fali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateus 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Lucas 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Hotu tiha Jesus foo sai ba Nia eskolante sira katak, Nia, Ema Umanu nia Oan tenki simu terus oi-oin. Nai ulun Judeu sira, nai lulik nia ulun sira ho mestri relijiaun sira sei la simu Nia. Ema sei oho tiha Nia, maibee too iha loron tolu, Nia sei moris fila fali. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Jesus hatete buat nee mo-moos deit. Rona nunee, Pedro dada Jesus ba sorin hodi siak Nia.<verse eid="MRK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Jesus fila oin hodi hateke ba Nia eskolante sira. I Nia siak Pedro dehan, “Satanás, sees tiha husi Hau nia oin! O nia hanoin nee laos mai husi Maromak, maibee mai husi ema nia hanoin.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Depois Jesus bolu ema barak nebee halibur iha nebaa atu mai besik hamutuk ho Nia eskolante sira. Nia dehan, “See mak hakarak tuir Hau, nia tenki husik tiha nia hakarak rasik, i tenki prontu simu terus, hanesan ema nebee lori nia krus too mate. I nia tenki tuir Hau nafatin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mateus 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Lucas 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 14:27">14:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Tanba see mak hakarak salva nia aan, nia sei lakon fali. I see mak lakon nia moris tanba nia tuir Hau hodi foo sai Liafuan Diak, nia sei hetan moris rohan-laek.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mateus 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Lucas 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">João 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Se ema ida hetan riku-soin mundu nian hotu-hotu, maibee too ikus la hetan moris rohan-laek karik, nia manaan saida loos? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />La iha buat ida mak nia bele foo hodi troka fali nia klamar.<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ema agora nee mesak aat deit i la foo laran ba Maromak. Se ema ruma moe atu simu Hau i lakohi simu Hau nia liafuan, aban-bainrua Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan mos sei moe atu rekonhese nia bainhira Hau fila fali mai husi lalehan. Hau sei tuun mai ho Aman Maromak nia kbiit tomak, i Maromak nia anju sira akompanha Hau.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jesus hatutan tan dehan, “Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, husi imi sira nee, balu sei moris too haree Maromak ukun ho kbiit boot mak foin sira mate.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus nakfilak Aan iha foho leten</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateus 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Lucas 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Liu tiha loron neen, Jesus lori Pedro, Tiago ho João, sira mes-mesak baa sae ba foho aas ida. Too iha nebaa, Nia eskolante nain tolu nee haree Jesus nakfilak Aan tiha. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Nia hena mos mutin nabilan tiha. Iha mundu nee, la iha ema ida mak bele halo hena sai mutin nabilan hanesan nee. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Derepenti sira haree profeta Elias ho Moisés koalia hela ho Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Haree nunee, Pedro dehan ba Jesus, “Mestri, ita hamutuk iha nee, furak. Diak liu ami halo tenda tolu, ida ba Ita Boot, ida ba Moisés, ho ida ba Elias.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Pedro la hatene atu koalia saida tanba sira nain tolu tauk teb-tebes.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Depois kalohan ida mai falun tiha sira. I lian ida sai husi kalohan nee dehan, “Ida nee Hau nia Oan doben. Imi tenki rona Nia!”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2 Pedro 1:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mateus 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Marcos 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lucas 3:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Eskolante nain tolu nee hateke ba-mai, sira la haree ema ida, so Jesus deit.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira tuun fali husi foho. Sira lao tuun dadauk, Jesus bandu dehan, “Saida mak ohin imi haree nee, la bele hatete ba ema ida. Bainhira Maromak halo Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan moris fali husi mate mak foin imi bele foo sai ba ema.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Buat nebee akontese nee, eskolante sira la foo sai ba ema ida. Maibee sira komesa husu ba malu dehan, “‘Moris fali husi mate’ nee dehan saida?”<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Depois sira husu ba Jesus dehan, “Nusaa mak mestri relijiaun sira dehan, Elias tenki mai uluk mak foin Mesias mai?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5">Malakias 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mateus 11:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Jesus hataan, “Loos duni, Elias sei mai uluk atu prepara buat hotu-hotu. Maski nunee keta haluha, iha Livru Sagradu mos hakerek dehan, Ema Umanu nia Oan tenki hetan terus barak i ema sei fila kotuk ba Nia. <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Maibee Hau hatete ba imi, Elias mai tiha ona, i ema halo aat nia tuir sira nia hakarak, hanesan saida mak hakerek ona iha Livru Sagradu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus duni sai espiritu aat husi labarik ida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mateus 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Lucas 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Depois Jesus ho Nia eskolante nain tolu nee fila fali ba iha eskolante sira seluk. Too iha nebaa, sira haree ema barak haleu eskolante sira, i mestri relijiaun sira diskuti malu hela ho sira. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bainhira ema barak nee haree Jesus, sira admira, i sira halai kedas atu baa simu Nia.<verse eid="MRK 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jesus husu sira, “Imi diskuti malu kona ba saida?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Husi ema barak nee iha mane ida hataan, “Mestri, hau mai lori hau nia oan mane atu hasoru Ita Boot, tanba espiritu aat iha nia laran halo nia la bele koalia. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Kuandu espiritu aat nee ataka ona nia, espiritu nee riba nia ba rai. Labarik nee nia kabeen mutin sai, nia ruun nehan, i nia isin toos tiha. Hau husu tiha ona Ita Boot nia eskolante sira atu duni sai espiritu aat nee, maibee sira la bele.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jesus siak sira dehan, “Imi ema nebee la fiar ba Maromak. Hau tenki hela ho imi too bainhira tan? Hau tenki pasiensia ho imi too iha nebee?! Lori labarik nee mai.”<verse eid="MRK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Nunee sira lori labarik nee ba Jesus. Maibee espiritu aat nee foin hetan Jesus, nia riba kedas labarik nee ba rai too labarik nee duir ba duir mai, i kabeen mutin mos sai husi ibun.<verse eid="MRK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jesus husu ba labarik nia aman, “Hori bainhira mak ita boot nia oan hetan moras hanesan nee?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Nia aman hataan, “Komesa nia sei kiik. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Dala barak espiritu aat nee soe nia ba iha ahi laran, ka halo nia mout iha bee laran, tanba hakarak atu oho nia. Maibee se Ita Boot bele halo buat ruma ba nia, entaun hanoin ami i tulun ami ba!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesus hataan, “Nusaa mak o dehan, ‘se Ita Boot bele’? See mak fiar, buat hotu bele deit.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Labarik nia aman hataan kedas ho lian makaas, “Hau fiar! Tulun hau atu hametin hau nia fiar nebee fraku nee.”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Jesus haree ema barak liu tan halai ba iha fatin nee. Nunee Nia foo orden ba espiritu aat nee dehan, “Espiritu nebee halo labarik nee tilun diuk ho la bele koalia, Hau haruka o sai ona husi labarik nee! I la bele tama tan iha nia!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Rona nunee, espiritu aat hakilar makaas i doko labarik nee makaas loos, depois sai tiha husi nia. Labarik nee haree ba hanesan ema mate. Nunee ema barak dehan, “Nia mate tiha ona!”<verse eid="MRK 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Maibee Jesus kaer labarik nia liman hodi ajuda nia hamriik. I labarik nee hamriik kedas.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Depois Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira tama fali iha uma ida, Nia eskolante sira husu Nia mes-mesak, “Nusaa mak ami ohin la bele duni sai espiritu aat nee?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jesus hataan, “Atu duni sai espiritu aat hanesan ida ohin nee, imi tenki halo orasaun [ho jejun].<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:29: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Liafuan “ho jejun” nee tama iha kopia barak, maibee iha kopia balu la tama.</char></note> Se lae, la bele.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus koalia tan kona ba Nia mate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateus 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Lucas 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira husik tiha fatin nee hodi lao liu husi provinsia Galileia. Jesus lakohi atu ema seluk hatene Nia iha nebee, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />tanba Nia atu hanorin deit Nia eskolante sira. Nia hatete ba sira, “Aban-bainrua ema sei faan Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan ba ema aat. Sira sei oho Hau, depois iha loron tolu Maromak sei halo Hau moris fali.” <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Maibee Nia eskolante sira la kompriende, i sira mos tauk atu husu ba Nia.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">See mak boot liu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateus 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Lucas 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira too iha sidade Kafarnaum. Sira tama iha uma ida, depois Jesus husu ba Nia eskolante sira dehan, “Ohin ita iha dalan, imi diskuti malu kona ba saida?” <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Maibee Nia eskolante sira nonook deit, tanba ohin iha dalan sira diskuti malu kona ba ida nebee mak boot liu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Lucas 22:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Jesus tuur, depois bolu Nia eskolante sanulu resin rua nee hamutuk hodi hanorin dehan, “See mak hakarak sai ema boot liu, nia tenki haraik aan sai ema ida nebee kiik liu hodi serbi nia maluk sira seluk hanesan atan.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26-27">Mateus 20:26-27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43-44">Marcos 10:43-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lucas 22:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Depois Jesus lori labarik ida mai hamriik iha eskolante sira nia klaran, i Nia hakuak labarik nee hodi dehan ba sira, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“See mak simu labarik ida hanesan nee hodi Hau nia naran, nia simu Hau. I see mak simu Hau, nia laos simu Hau deit, maibee nia simu mos Ida nebee haruka Hau mai.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mateus 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Lucas 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">João 13:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema nebee la kontra ita, nia hamutuk ho ita</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Lucas 9:49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />João foo hatene ba Jesus dehan, “Mestri, ami haree ema ida duni sai diabu hodi Ita Boot nia naran. Ami bandu nia, tanba nia laos ita nia ema.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Maibee Jesus hataan, “La bele bandu! Tanba la iha ema ida mak halo milagre hodi Hau nia naran depois iha tempu badak nia laran nia hatete aat fali Hau. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ema nebee la kontra ita, nia hamutuk ho ita.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mateus 12:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Lucas 11:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Hau dehan lo-loos ba imi, see mak foo tulun ba imi tanba imi lori Mesias nia naran, maski nia foo bee kopu ida deit mos, Maromak la haluha nia kolen.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mateus 10:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keta halimar ho sala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateus 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Lucas 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Jesus hatutan tan dehan, “See mak halo labarik kiik ida monu ba sala too la fiar mai Hau, ema nee sei simu kastigu todan. Ba nia, diak liu ema kesi fatuk boot ida iha nia kakorok depois soe nia tama ba tasi laran! Tanba kastigu nebee nia sei simu todan liu fali ida nee.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Se o nia liman halo o monu ba sala karik, tesi tiha. Diak liu o tama iha lalehan ho liman sorin deit duke o tama ba iha infernu ho liman kompletu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mateus 5:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Iha nebaa ular nunka mate, i ahi lakan hela deit.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Kopia balu hakerek versikulu 44 nee, maibee kopia nebee antigu liu lae.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Se o nia ain halo o monu ba sala karik, tesi tiha. Diak liu o tama iha lalehan ho ain sorin deit duke o tama ba iha infernu ho ain kompletu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Iha nebaa ular nunka mate, i ahi lakan hela deit.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:46: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Kopia balu hakerek versikulu 46 nee, maibee kopia nebee antigu liu lae.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Se o nia matan halo o monu ba sala karik, sukit sai tiha o nia matan nee. Diak liu o tama ba iha Maromak nia reinu ho matan sorin deit duke o tama ba iha infernu ho matan kompletu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mateus 5:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Iha nebaa, ‘ular nunka mate, i ahi lakan hela deit.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Isaias 66:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Ema hotu-hotu sei liu husi ahi para sai meer tiha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:49: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Kopia balu hakerek tan, “I sakrifisiu tunu hotu-hotu sei tau masin para sai meer.” Tuir matenek nain balu kona ba Biblia, ida nee koalia kona ba terus nebee koko ita.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Masin nee buat diak ida. Maibee se masin nee sai miis tiha ona karik, ita la bele halo meer fila fali. Imi mos tenki sai meer hanesan masin hodi moris dame malu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateus 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Lucas 14:34-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Farizeu sira husu kona ba feen-laen soe malu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateus 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Lucas 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Jesus sai husi fatin nee hodi baa iha provinsia Judeia ho fat-fatin iha mota Jordaun nia sorin ba. Iha nebaa mos ema barak mai haleu Nia, i Jesus hanorin sira hanesan baibain.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Depois ema balu husi grupu Farizeu mai koko atu hamonu Nia. Sira husu, “Tuir Moisés nia lei, laen soe nia feen, bele ka lae?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jesus hataan, “Moisés nia lei hatete saida?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Sira hataan, “Moisés foo lisensa dehan, laen bele soe nia feen, naran katak nia foo surat deklarasaun soe malu nian.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1-4">Deuteronómiu 24:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mateus 5:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Jesus hataan, “Moisés hakerek lei nee tanba imi nia ulun toos. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Maibee fo-foun Maromak halo lalehan ho rai, Maromak ‘halo sira mane ho feto.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Jénesis 1:27</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Tanba nee, mane sei husik nia inan-aman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:7">hodi baa moris neon ida laran ida ho nia feen,<verse eid="MRK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q3">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />i sira nain rua sai ona ida.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:8">Entaun sira laos ona ema nain rua, maibee sai ona ida.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Jénesis 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Nee duni se Maromak tau feto ho mane hamutuk sai feen-laen ona, ema keta fahe fali.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira tama fali ba iha uma, depois eskolante sira husu kona ba Nia liafuan ohin nee.<verse eid="MRK 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Jesus hataan ba sira dehan, “Se mane soe nia feen hodi hola fali feto seluk, mane nee halo sala seksual hasoru nia feen. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />I feto mos hanesan. Se nia soe tiha nia laen hodi hola fali mane seluk, nia mos halo sala seksual.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11-12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mateus 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1 Korintu 7:10-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus foo bensaun ba labarik</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateus 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Lucas 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Iha loron ida, ema balu mai lori labarik ba Jesus atu Nia tau liman ba sira hodi foo bensaun ba sira. Maibee Jesus nia eskolante sira bandu.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Haree nunee, Jesus siak Nia eskolante sira dehan, “Husik labarik sira nee mai iha Hau, la bele bandu. Tanba ema hanesan labarik sira nee mak sai Maromak nia reinu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, see mak atu sai Maromak nia reinu, nia tenki laran metin ba Maromak hanesan labarik sira nee. Se lae, la bele.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mateus 18:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Jesus hakuak labarik sira nee, i tau liman ba labarik ida-idak nia ulun hodi foo bensaun ba sira.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema riku nebee hakarak tama lalehan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateus 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Lucas 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Jesus foin sai husi fatin nee, ema riku ida halai mai hasoru Jesus. Nia hakruuk iha Jesus nia oin hodi husu, “Mestri nebee diak, hau tenki halo saida para hau bele hetan moris rohan-laek?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jesus hataan, “Tanba saa mak ita dehan, Hau ema diak? La iha ema ida mak diak, so Maromak deit. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ita hatene ona, Nai Maromak nia ukun fuan nebee dehan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:19">‘La bele oho ema.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:19">La bele halo sala ho ema nia feen ka laen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:19">La bele naok.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:19">La bele foo testemunhu falsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:19">La bele han-matak ema nia sasaan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 10:19">I respeita o nia inan-aman.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Ézodu 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Deuteronómiu 5:16-20</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Ema nee hataan, “Mestri, komesa hau sei kiik, ukun fuan sira nee hau halo tuir hotu ona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jesus hateke ba nia ho domin hodi dehan, “Maibee ita sei falta buat ida. Agora baa faan tiha ita nia riku-soin hotu, i osan nee foo ba ema kiak. Nunee mak ita sei hetan fali riku-soin iha lalehan. Fahe hotu tiha, mai tuir Hau.”<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Rona nunee, ema nee hatudu nia oin tristi, i nia fila ho laran susar tanba nia riku teb-tebes.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Depois Jesus haree ba-mai, i hatete ba Nia eskolante sira, “Ema riku susar teb-tebes atu sai Maromak nia reinu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Rona tiha liafuan nee, Jesus nia eskolante sira hakfodak. Maibee Jesus hatete dala ida tan, “Oan sira, susar teb-tebes atu sai Maromak nia reinu. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Kuda kamelu tama liu husi daun kuak susar teb-tebes. Maibee susar liu tan, ema riku ida atu sai Maromak nia reinu hodi hakruuk ba Nia nudar Liurai.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Jesus nia eskolante sira admira teb-tebes hodi husu, “Se nunee, see loos mak sei hetan salvasaun?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jesus hateke ba sira hodi dehan, “Ba ema, la bele duni. Maibee ba Maromak buat hotu-hotu bele. La iha buat ida mak la bele.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Pedro dehan, “Ami husik tiha ona buat hotu-hotu hodi tuir Ita Boot.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jesus hataan, “Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, Maromak sei foo bensaun ba see-see deit mak husik ona nia uma, nia maun-alin, nia inan-aman, nia oan sira ka nia toos tanba nia tuir Hau i foo sai Liafuan Diak. <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />Uma, maun-alin, inan, oan ho rai nebee nia husik ona nee, nia sei simu tan dala atus ida iha mundu nee. Nia mos sei hetan terus tanba nia tuir Hau. I bainhira nia husik ona mundu nee, nia sei hetan moris rohan-laek. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Maibee ema barak nebee agora boot sei sai kiik. I ema barak nebee agora kiik sei sai boot.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:31: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lian Gregu hakerek dehan, “Ema barak nebee agora primeiru, sei sai fali ikus. I ema nebee agora ikus, sei sai fali primeiru.” Iha sira nia lian, “ema primeiru” signifika “ema boot”. I “ema ikus” dehan “ema kiik”. Haree mos Mateus 20:16; Lucas 13:30.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus koalia ba dala tolu kona ba Nia mate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateus 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Lucas 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira lao dadauk sae ba iha Jerusalém. Jesus lao uluk. Nia eskolante sira admira, i ema barak nebee mak lao husi kotuk tauk. Dala ida tan Jesus halibur Nia eskolante nain sanulu resin rua mesak deit hodi foo sai ba sira saida mak atu akontese ba Nia. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Nia hatete, “Rona mai! Ita lao dadauk ba Jerusalém. Too iha nebaa, ema sei entrega Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan ba iha nai lulik nia ulun sira ho mestri relijiaun sira. Ema sira nee sei tesi Hau nia lia katak, Hau tenki hetan kastigu mate. Sira sei entrega Hau ba iha ema nebee la fiar Maromak. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Depois ema sira nee sei hamoe Hau, tafui kabeen mai Hau, baku Hau ho sikoti, i oho Hau. Maibee iha loron tolu Hau sei moris fali.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tiago ho João husu atu sai ema boot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateus 20:20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Hotu tiha Zebedeu nia oan Tiago ho João baa husu Jesus, “Mestri, ami hakarak Ita Boot halo tuir buat nebee mak ami atu husu nee.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jesus husu fali, “Imi hakarak Hau halo saida ba imi?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Sira hataan, “Ami husu atu aban-bainrua Ita Boot tuur iha naroman lalehan nian, ami nain rua nee, ida tuur iha Ita Boot nia sorin loos, ida seluk tuur iha Ita Boot nia sorin karuk.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Maibee Jesus hatete ba sira dehan, “Imi la kompriende saida mak imi husu. La kleur tan Hau sei simu susar ho terus todan. Imi mos prontu simu susar ho terus nee ka lae?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tradusaun literal dehan, “Imi bele hemu husi kopu nebee Hau hemu ka? Imi bele simu batizmu nebee Hau simu ka?” Iha Biblia, “hemu husi kopu” dala barak signifika hetan terus. Batizmu iha nee mos signifika tama liu husi susar laran, hanesan ema nebee simu batizmu tama liu husi bee laran.</char></note> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:50">Lucas 12:50</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Sira hataan, “Ami prontu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jesus hatete ba sira, “Loos duni, imi sei simu duni susar ho terus hanesan Hau. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Maibee Hau la iha direitu atu hili see mak atu tuur iha Hau nia sorin loos ho sorin karuk. Kona ba ida nee, Maromak desidi tiha ona.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Bainhira eskolante nain sanulu rona buat nebee mak Tiago ho João husu, sira hirus maun-alin nain rua nee. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Entaun Jesus bolu sira hamutuk hodi dehan, “Imi hatene katak, iha nasaun sel-seluk, ema sira nebee hanaran nai ulun, sira manda ema tuun-sae, i ukun nain sira hanehan sira nia povu. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Maibee imi la bele halo hanesan nee. Husi imi sira nee, see mak hakarak sai boot, nia tenki haraik aan hodi serbi nia maluk sira seluk.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25-26">Lucas 22:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />See mak hakarak sai ema boot liu, nia tenki sai atan ba ema hotu-hotu hodi serbi sira.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:43-44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mateus 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Marcos 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Lucas 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan mos mai iha mundu nee laos atu ema serbi Hau. Maibee Hau mai atu serbi ema seluk i foo Aan ba mate atu ema barak hetan liberdade.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kura ema matan delek ida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateus 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Lucas 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Depois Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira too iha sidade Jerikó. Bainhira sira lao sai fali husi sidade nee, ema barak mos tuir. Iha ema matan delek ida tuur hela iha dalan ninin hodi husu ezmola. Nia naran Bartimeu, nee katak “Timeu nia oan”. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Bainhira nia rona dehan, ema ida liu nee Jesus husi Nazaré, nia komesa bolu ho lian makaas dehan, “Jesus, liurai David nia Jerasaun, hanoin hau ba!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Ema barak siak nia hodi haruka nia nonook. Maibee nia bolu makaas liu tan dehan, “Liurai David nia Jerasaun, hanoin hau ba!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jesus mos para tiha hodi dehan, “Bolu nia mai!” Entaun sira bolu ema matan delek nee dehan, “Keta tauk! Hamriik ba! Mestri bolu o.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Rona nunee, Bartimeu soe tiha nia hena, hamriik kedas i baa hasoru Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jesus husu, “O hakarak Hau halo saida ba o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Ema matan delek nee hataan, “Mestri, hau hakarak haree.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jesus hatete, “O hetan kura tanba o fiar mai Hau. O bele baa ona.” Ema nee nia matan diak kedas. I nia lao tuir Jesus.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Ema barak haklalak simu Nai Jesus tama iha Jerusalém</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateus 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lucas 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">João 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Bainhira Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira besik ona sidade Jerusalém, sira too iha aldeia Betfagé ho Betánia iha foho Oliveira nia lolon, Nia haruka Nia eskolante nain rua baa uluk. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Nia dehan ba sira, “Imi baa iha aldeia nebaa. Bainhira imi tama, imi haree kedas kuda buru oan ida kesi hela, ema ida seidauk sae. Kore tiha dada mai. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Se ema ruma husu karik, ‘Nusaa mak imi halo buat nee?’, hatete ba nia, ‘Nai mak presiza.’ Ema nee sei haruka imi dada kedas kuda buru nee.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Entaun sira nain rua mos baa. Sira hetan kuda buru oan nee kesi hela iha uma oin, iha dalan ibun. Bainhira sira kore dadauk kuda nia talin, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />ema balu nebee hamriik hela iha nebaa husu, “Imi halo saida iha nee? Nusaa mak imi kore fali kuda buru nee?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Sira hataan tuir buat nebee Jesus hatete ona ba sira, depois ema sira nee husik sira lori kuda buru nee. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />I sira dada kuda buru nee lori ba Jesus. Too iha nebaa, sira hasai sira nia hena tau ba iha kuda nia kotuk, depois Jesus sae.<verse eid="MRK 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ema barak hasai sira nia hena hodi nahe tu-tuir dalan. Iha mos ema balu taa ramus tahan iha toos hodi nahe tuir dalan. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ema balu lao uluk iha Jesus nia oin, iha balu lao husi kotuk. Sira hotu haklalak hahii Maromak dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">“Hosana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:9">Maromak foo bensaun ba Ida nebee mak mai lori Nai Maromak nia naran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Salmu 118:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Maromak foo bensaun ba liurai David nia Jerasaun nebee mai atu ukun.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Hosana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 11:10">hahii Nia iha fatin aas liu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jesus tama iha Jerusalém, Nia baa iha uma kreda boot hodi haree buat hotu iha nebaa. Tanba rai atu kalan ona, Nia ho Nia eskolante sanulu resin rua fila fali ba iha Betánia.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus foo malisan ba ai huun nebee la foo fuan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mateus 21:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Aban fali Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira sai husi Betánia. Iha dalan Jesus hamlaha. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Husi dook Nia haree tiha ona ai figeira huun, nia tahan buras. Nunee Nia baa atu haree ai nee nia fuan iha ka lae. Maibee bainhira too iha ai huun, Nia haree ai fuan ida mos la iha, so tahan deit, tanba laos tempu atu foo fuan. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Jesus hatete ba ai huun nee dehan, “Hahuu agora la iha ema ida mak haan tan o nia fuan.” Nia eskolante sira rona hela liafuan nee.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus duni sai kontratu nain sira husi uma kreda boot</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateus 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Lucas 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">João 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Depois Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira too iha Jerusalém. Jesus tama iha area uma kreda boot, i duni sai ema sira nebee mak halo kontratu iha fatin nee. Nia baku fila tiha meza nebee mak ema uza hodi troka osan, banku nebee mak ema tuur hodi faan manu pombu mos Nia baku fila hotu. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Nia mos bandu ema atu la bele lori sasaan liu husi area uma kreda boot. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Depois Jesus hanorin ema sira iha nebaa dehan, “Iha Maromak nia liafuan hakerek tiha ona dehan, ‘Hau nia uma nee fatin ba ema husi nasaun hotu-hotu atu halo orasaun.’ Maibee imi halo fali hanesan ema naok-teen sira nia subar fatin.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isaias 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Jeremias 7:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Nai lulik nia ulun sira ho mestri relijiaun sira rona saida mak akontese nee. Entaun sira komesa buka dalan atu oho Jesus. Sira tauk Jesus tanba Nia hanorin halo ema barak admira.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Rai besik kalan ona, Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira sai fali husi sidade.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisaun husi ai figeira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateus 21:20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Aban dadeer-saan, Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira liu husi fatin horiseik, sira haree ai figeira nee mate tiha ona, too nia abut maran hotu. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pedro hanoin fali Jesus nia liafuan nebee natoon Nia hatete ba ai figeira nee, entaun Pedro dehan ba Jesus, “Mestri, haree ba! Ai figeira huun nebee Ita Boot foo malisan nee mate tiha ona.”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jesus hataan, “Fiar ba Maromak! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, see deit mak haruka foho ida nee muda ba iha tasi laran, foho nee sei muda duni. Naran katak nia laran metin ba buat nebee nia husu, i la duvida.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mateus 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Korintu 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Nee duni Hau hatete ba imi, bainhira imi husu saida deit liu husi orasaun, imi tenki fiar katak imi sei simu. Se imi fiar nunee mak imi sei hetan duni. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Se imi halo orasaun i hanoin hetan ema ruma halo sala hasoru imi, perdua nia sala ba, atu nunee imi nia Aman iha lalehan mos perdua imi nia sala. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />[Maibee se imi la perdua ema, imi nia Aman iha lalehan mos sei la perdua imi nia sala.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Versikulu 26 nee tama iha kopia nee balu, maibee iha kopia nebee antigu liu la tama.</char></note> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14-15">Mateus 6:14-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai ulun husu see mak foo direitu ba Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateus 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Lucas 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira tama fali iha Jerusalém. Jesus lao hela iha area uma kreda boot, nai lulik nia ulun sira, mestri relijiaun sira ho katuas lia nain sira mai hasoru Nia. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Sira husu dehan, “O iha direitu saida para halo buat sira nee? See mak foo direitu nee ba O?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jesus hataan, “Hau mos atu husu buat ida. Hataan mai took. Depois mak Hau foo hatene imi, see mak foo direitu mai Hau hodi halo buat sira nee. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Foo hatene took Hau: See mak foo direitu ba João Sarani Nain hodi foo sarani ema? Maromak mak foo ka, ema mak foo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Sira diskuti malu dehan, “Ita susar ona. Se ita hataan, ‘Maromak mak foo direitu ba nia,’ Jesus sei husu fali ita dehan, ‘Entaun, nusaa mak imi la fiar ba nia?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Maibee ita mos la bele dehan, ‘Ema mak foo direitu.’ ” Sira dehan nunee tanba sira tauk povu, tanba povu sira hanoin dehan, João nee Maromak nia profeta ida duni.<verse eid="MRK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Nunee sira hataan dehan, “Ami la hatene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jesus dehan ba sira, “Se nunee, Hau mos la hatete ba imi, see mak foo direitu mai Hau hodi halo buat sira nee.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Komparasaun kona ba ema nebee aluga toos uvas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateus 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Lucas 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Jesus koalia nafatin ho nai lulik nia ulun sira, mestri relijiaun sira, ho katuas lia nain sira. Nia halo komparasaun nunee: “Iha toos nain ida kuda uvas iha nia toos ida tomak. Nia halo lutu haleu tiha toos nee, i kee rai kuak halo tanki ida atu hasai uvas been. Nia mos harii fatin aas ida ba seguransa sira atu hein toos nee. Hotu tiha, nia foo ba ema aluga, depois nia baa hela iha rai liur.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isaias 5:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Too tempu kuu uvas, toos nain haruka nia baa simu ninia parte husi ema nebee mak aluga toos. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Maibee sira kaer nia, baku nia, i duni nia fila ho liman mamuk. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Depois toos nain haruka tan nia atan ida baa. Maibee sira baku kanek nia ulun, i tarata nia. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Toos nain haruka tan atan ida seluk, maibee ida nee sira oho tiha. Toos nain haruka nafatin nia atan sel-seluk, balu sira baku i balu sira oho.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Too ikus la iha tan ema ida mak nia bele haruka baa foti nia parte, hela deit nia oan mane nebee nia hadomi. Entaun nia haruka nia oan nee baa. Nia hanoin dehan, ‘Sira sei respeita hau nia oan.’<verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Maibee bainhira toos nain nia oan too iha nebaa, ema aluga toos nee dehan ba malu, ‘Nia mak sei hetan nia aman nia riku-soin tomak. Diak liu ita oho tiha nia, atu toos nee sai ita nian fali.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Nunee sira kaer nia, oho nia, depois rasta nia mate isin sai husi toos laran.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Konta hotu tiha, Jesus husu ba nai ulun relijiaun sira dehan, “Agora, toos nain sei halo saida? Nia sei baa oho tiha sira hotu, depois foo fali toos nee ba ema seluk aluga. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Iha Livru Sagradu kompara Mesias hanesan fatuk ida. Imi nunka lee ka? Iha nebaa dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Iha fatuk ida nebee badaen fatuk sira lakohi uza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">maibee agora fatuk nee mak sai fali fatuk nebee prinsipal.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Nai Maromak rasik mak hili fatuk nee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">ita haree ba furak teb-tebes.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10-11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Salmu 118:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Nai ulun relijiaun sira rona komparasaun nee, sira hatene katak Jesus konta istoria nee hodi hatudu sira nia sala. Nunee sira buka dalan atu kaer Nia, maibee sira tauk ema lubun boot nee, entaun sira husik Nia sai husi fatin nee.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pergunta kona ba selu impostu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateus 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Lucas 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Hotu tiha nai ulun relijiaun sira haruka ema Farizeu balu ho partidu Herodes nia membru balu baa hasoru Jesus hodi husu pergunta oi-oin ho intensaun atu hamonu Nia. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Too iha Jesus, sira husu, “Mestri, ami hatene katak Ita Boot ema nebee mak moris loos. Ita Boot la preokupa ema seluk nia hanoin, tanba Ita Boot la fihir ema. Ita Boot sempre hanorin ho loos kona ba Maromak nia hakarak. Ami nia pergunta mak nee: Tuir ita nia lei relijiaun, ita selu impostu ba liurai boot César, nee loos ka la loos? Ita tenki selu ka lae?”<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Maibee Jesus hatene katak sira koalia oin ida hahalok oin seluk, nunee Nia dehan ba sira, “Nusaa mak imi hakarak hamonu Hau? Lori took osan mutin ida mai Hau haree.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Sira lori osan mutin ida foo ba Jesus, i Nia husu ba sira, “See nia oin mak iha osan nee? I see nia naran?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Sira hataan, “Liurai boot César nian.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Jesus hatete ba sira, “Entaun foo ba estadu buat nebee mak estadu nian, i foo ba Maromak buat nebee mak Maromak nian.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Rona nunee, sira admira.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus hanorin kona ba ema mate moris fila fali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateus 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Lucas 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Depois ema husi grupu Saduseu mos mai koko Jesus. Ema Saduseu sira hanorin dehan, ema mate sei la moris fali. Entaun sira husu ba Jesus,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />“Mestri, Moisés hakerek lei ida rai hela mai ita dehan nunee: Se mane ida mate husik hela nia kaben, maibee la iha oan, mane nia alin tenki kaben fali ho feto faluk nee, para bele foo jerasaun ba nia maun.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Deuteronómiu 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Entaun, hanesan nee: Uluk iha maun-alin nain hitu. Maun boot kaben, depois nia mate, la iha oan. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Entaun nia alin ida tuir nia nee, kaben fali ho feto faluk nee. La kleur nia mos mate, la iha oan. Nunee mos ho nia alin tuir mai. Nia kaben ho feto faluk nee, maibee nia mate, la iha oan. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Nunee nafatin too nain hitu nee mate hotu, la iha oan. Ikus liu feto nee mos mate. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Agora ami husu nunee: Feto nee kaben ho mane nain hitu. Aban-bainrua Maromak halo moris fali ema mate, feto nee nia kaben mak ida nebee loos?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesus hataan dehan, “Imi nia hanoin nee sala liu! Tanba imi la hatene saida mak hakerek iha Livru Sagradu, i la kompriende Maromak nia kbiit. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Bainhira ema mate moris fila fali, sira la kaben tan ona. Maibee sira hanesan anju sira iha lalehan. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Agora, kona ba ema mate moris fali, imi nunka lee Moisés nia livru nebee hakerek kona ba ahi lakan iha ai huun kiikoan ida ka? Iha momentu nebaa Maromak foo hatene ba Moisés dehan, ‘Hau mak o nia bei-ala Abraão nia Maromak, Isac nia Maromak ho Jacó nia Maromak, sira hotu adora nafatin Hau too agora.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Ézodu 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Nee hatudu katak ema mate sei moris fali. Tanba so ema moris deit mak bele adora Maromak, ema mate lae. Imi nia hanoin sala duni.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukun fuan nebee mak importante liu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateus 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lucas 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Iha mestri relijiaun ida mai rona Jesus diskuti malu ho ema Saduseu sira. Mestri relijiaun nee haree katak Jesus hataan sira nia pergunta ho diak, entaun nia husu ba Jesus, “Husi ukun fuan hotu-hotu, ida nebee mak importante liu?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jesus hataan, “Ukun fuan ida importante liu mak nee: ‘Rona mai Israel oan sira! Maromak, ita nia Nai, Nia mesak ida deit. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />O tenki hadomi Maromak, o nia Nai, ho o nia aan tomak, ho laran tomak, ho neon tomak, ho forsa tomak.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Deuteronómiu 6:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Ukun fuan ida segundu mak nee: ‘O tenki hadomi o nia maluk hanesan o hadomi o nia aan rasik.’ La iha tan ukun fuan seluk mak importante liu ukun fuan rua nee.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Levítiku 19:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Mestri relijiaun nee hataan fali, “Mestri, Ita Boot nia resposta nee diak! Ita Boot dehan nee loos duni. Maromak mesak ida deit, la iha tan Maromak seluk.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Deuteronómiu 4:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ita tenki hadomi Maromak ho laran tomak, ho hanoin tomak, ho forsa tomak. I ita mos tenki hadomi ita nia maluk hanesan ita hadomi ita nia aan rasik. Buat rua nee importante liu fali sakrifisiu tunu ho mos sakrifisiu sel-seluk.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Oseias 6:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Jesus haree mestri relijiaun nee hataan ho matenek. Nunee Nia dehan, “Ita boot besik atu sai Maromak nia reinu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Hotu tiha la iha ema ida brani husu tan pergunta ba Jesus.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Lucas 10:25-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesias, Salvador nebee atu mai nee see?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateus 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Lucas 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Jesus hanorin hela ema barak iha area uma kreda boot, Nia dehan, “Nusaa mak mestri relijiaun sira dehan, Mesias liurai David nia Jerasaun? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Afinal Espiritu Santu foo hanoin ba David atu foo sai dehan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Nai Maromak hatete ona ba hau nia Nai dehan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">“Mai tuur iha Hau nia sorin loos,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="MRK 12:36">too Hau hamonu O nia inimigu sira iha O nia ain okos.”’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Salmu 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Iha nee liurai David rasik bolu Mesias nee nia Nai. Entaun oinsaa mak Mesias nee bele sai fali David nia Jerasaun?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Ema barak nebee rona Jesus nia hanorin nee, sira gosta loos.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus kritika mestri relijiaun sira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateus 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Lucas 20:45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Momentu Jesus sei hanorin ema barak nee, Nia dehan, “Imi tenki kuidadu di-diak ho mestri relijiaun sira. Sira gosta lao hatais batina naruk, i gosta ema kumprimenta sira iha merkadu. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Kuandu iha uma kreda laran ka iha festa, sira gosta tuur iha oin hanesan ema boot. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Maibee sira mos gosta han-matak feto faluk sira hodi hadau sira nia uma, i sira finji harohan nar-naruk para ema haree. Maromak sei kastigu sira todan liu fali ema seluk.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Feto faluk kiak ida foo oferta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Lucas 21:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Jesus tuur besik kaixa oferta iha uma kreda boot hodi haree ema tau osan ba iha kaixa oferta nee. Iha ema riku barak tau osan boot. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Iha mos feto faluk kiak ida mai tau osan oferta sentavus rua ba iha kaixa laran, osan nee nia folin kiik loos.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Haree nunee, Jesus bolu Nia eskolante sira hodi dehan, “Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, oferta nebee feto faluk kiak nee foo, nia folin boot liu fali oferta sira sel-seluk. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Sira seluk foo husi sira nia osan restu. Maibee feto faluk nee foo hotu buat nebee nia iha. Atu hola hahaan mos, la iha ona.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Uma kreda boot sei rahun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateus 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Lucas 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira sai husi uma kreda boot. Sira sai dadauk, Nia eskolante ida dehan nunee: “Mestri, haree took uma kreda nee! Uma sira nee hada ho fatuk bo-boot deit, haree ba kapaas loos.”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jesus dehan ba nia, “Haree di-diak uma bo-boot sira nee. Too loron ida, buat sira nee sei rahun hotu. Fatuk sira nee hotu sei tetuk too rai.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Terus boot sei mai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-28">Mateus 24:3-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-24">Lucas 21:7-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Depois Jesus lao baa tuur iha foho Oliveira hodi hateke ba uma kreda boot. Pedro, Tiago, João ho André husu Nia mes-mesak, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Hatete took mai ami, buat nebee ohin Ita Boot koalia nee, bainhira mak sei akontese? Kuandu buat sira nee atu akontese, sinal saida mak sei mosu?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jesus hataan dehan, “Kuidadu di-diak para ema la bele bosok imi. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ema barak sei mai lori Hau nia naran dehan sira nee mak Mesias. I sira lohi ema barak atu lao sala dalan. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Imi sei rona kona ba funu oi-oin, i ema sei konta tutan kona ba funu iha fat-fatin. Bainhira imi rona nunee, keta tauk. Buat sira nee tenki akontese uluk, maibee nee laos dehan katak mundu atu remata ona. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Nasaun sei funu hasoru nasaun, estadu sei funu hasoru estadu. Rai sei nakdoko iha fat-fatin, sei iha rai hamlaha boot. Maibee susar sira nee foin mak hahuu, hanesan feto isin rua nebee foin kanotak moras atu tuur ahi.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Kuidadu, tanba ema sei mai kaer imi hodi lori imi ba iha tribunal. Sira sei baku imi ho sikoti iha sira nia uma kreda laran. Sira mos sei foo sala ba imi iha nai ulun ho liurai sira nia oin, tanba imi tuir Hau. Ho nunee imi sei foo sasin kona ba Hau iha sira nia oin. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Liafuan Diak kona ba Hau, tenki foo sai iha nasaun hotu-hotu, depois mak foin mundu remata. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Bainhira ema kaer imi hodi lori imi ba iha tribunal, lalika preokupa kona ba saida mak imi atu hataan iha nebaa. Hataan deit saida mak Maromak foo hatene ba imi iha momentu nebaa. Tanba liafuan nebee imi koalia nee laos imi nia liafuan rasik, maibee mai husi Espiritu Santu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mateus 10:17-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Lucas 12:11-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Ema sei sai traidor hodi faan nia maun-alin rasik atu ema oho. Nunee mos aman sira sei entrega sira nia oan atu ema oho. Oan sira sei kontra sira nia inan-aman, i entrega ba ema aat atu oho. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Ema hotu-hotu sei odi imi tanba imi tuir Hau. Maibee see mak tuir nafatin Hau too rohan, Maromak sei salva nia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mateus 10:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Iha buat ida aat liu mak sei tama ba iha fatin lulik iha uma kreda boot, halo too Maromak hakribi. See mak lee liafuan nee, kompriende ba! Bainhira imi haree buat aat nee, imi nebee iha provinsia Judeia tenki halai ona ba foho.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Daniel 9:27</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11:31</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Iha loron nee, ema nebee iha hela liur, la bele tama ba iha uma laran hodi foti sasaan. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />I ema nebee iha hela toos, la bele fila baa foti nia hena iha uma.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Lucas 17:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Iha tempu nee, feto isin rua ho inan sira nebee foo susu nia oan, sei terus teb-tebes. <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Harohan ba Maromak atu buat nee la bele akontese iha tempu malirin. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Tanba iha tempu nee, ema sei terus aat liu. Komesa husi Maromak halo lalehan ho rai too agora, seidauk iha terus aat ida hanesan nee. I kuandu terus boot nee liu tiha, sei la akontese tan hanesan nee.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Daniel 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Apokalipse 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Se Nai Maromak la habadak tempu terus nee, la iha tan ema ida mak moris. Maibee Nia sei habadak duni, tanba Nia hadomi ema nebee mak Nia hili tiha ona.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Iha tempu nee, se ema ruma dehan ba imi, ‘Haree took, Mesias iha nee’ ka ‘Mesias iha nebaa’, keta fiar. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Tanba ema sei mai bosok dehan sira mak Mesias ka sira Maromak nia profeta. Sira sei hatudu milagre bo-boot nebee halo ema admira, atu nunee sira bele lohi ema hotu-hotu atu lao sala dalan. Too ema nebee Maromak hili mos sira hakarak hamonu. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Entaun matan moris! Hau foo sai tiha ona buat hotu-hotu ba imi molok buat sira nee akontese.”<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus sei fila fali mai husi lalehan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-35">Mateus 24:29-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-33">Lucas 21:25-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Bainhira loron terus nee liu tiha, loro matan sai nakukun tiha, fulan mos la foo naroman tan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isaias 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7">Ezequiel 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joel 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref>, <ref loc="JOL 3:15">3:15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:12">Apokalipse 6:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Fitun sira iha lalehan sei monu namtate, i forsa hotu-hotu iha kalohan leten sei nakdoko.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 34:4">Isaias 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Joel 2:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 6:13">Apokalipse 6:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Depois ema hotu-hotu sei haree Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan tuun mai iha kalohan leten, ho kbiit boot ho naroman lalehan nian.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniel 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Apokalipse 1:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />I Hau sei haruka Hau nia anju sira halibur ema sira nebee mak Hau hili tiha ona husi mundu tomak, husi rai ulun too rai ikun.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Hanoin took ai figeira, i aprende husi ai nee. Bainhira ai figeira nia sanak komesa matak i nia dikin komesa sai, imi hatene katak bailoron besik ona. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nunee mos bainhira imi haree buat sira nee akontese, imi hatene katak Hau besik mai ona, Hau iha ona odamatan oin. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, husi ema hotu nebee mak moris iha tempu nee, iha balu sei moris too buat sira nee hotu akontese. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Lalehan ho rai sei remata, maibee Hau nia liafuan sei la remata.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">La iha ema ida hatene bainhira mak Nai Jesus atu mai fali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mateus 24:36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />“Kona ba loron ka oras nebee mak Hau atu fila fali mai, la iha ema ida mak hatene. Anju sira iha lalehan mos la hatene, i Hau, Maromak nia Oan mos lae. So Aman Maromak deit mak hatene.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mateus 24:36</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Nee duni matan moris neon nain ba. Tanba imi la hatene bainhira loos mak Hau atu fila fali mai. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Nee sei hanesan uma nain ida nebee sai husi uma atu baa iha rai dook. Nia haruka nia atan sira mak tau matan ba nia uma, i foo knaar ba atan ida-idak. Ba ida hein odamatan, nia hameno hela atu halo seguransa di-diak.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Lucas 12:36-38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Entaun imi tenki matan moris, tanba imi la hatene bainhira loos mak uma nain fila fali mai. Nia atu mai lokraik ka kalan boot ka, dadeer-saan nakukun ka loron matan sae, imi la hatene. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Keta halo be nia fila derepenti, nia haree imi toba dukur hela.<verse eid="MRK 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Nunee, saida mak Hau hatete ba imi nee, Hau hatete mos ba ema hotu-hotu: Imi tenki matan moris neon nain. ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Ema boot sira buka dalan atu oho Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateus 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lucas 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">João 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Falta loron rua tan festa Paskua ho Festa Paun la Tau Fermentu. Nai lulik nia ulun sira ho mestri relijiaun sira buka dalan atu kaer Jesus ho nonook deit hodi oho. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Maibee sira hatete, “La bele kaer Nia iha loron festa nee, se lae povu bele halo rungu-ranga.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Ézodu 12:1-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Feto ida fui mina morin ba Nai Jesus nia ulun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateus 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">João 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Jesus baa iha aldeia Betánia hodi haan iha Simão ida nebee uluk moras lepra nia uma. Jesus sei haan hela, feto ida mai lori botir ida halo husi fatuk murak, mina morin karun teb-tebes mak iha laran. Nia baa besik Jesus, i baku rahun tiha botir nee nia ibun hodi fui mina morin ba iha Jesus nia ulun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina morin nee nia naran “</char><char style="it">nardu</char>”, ema halo husi ai abut morin ida. Botir mina nian nee, ema bahat husi fatuk murak ida naran “<char style="it">alabastru</char>”. Mina nee nia folin <char style="it">denáriu</char> 300.</note><verse eid="MRK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Ema balu iha nebaa hirus hodi dehan ba malu, “Nusaa mak nia estraga fali mina morin nee? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Se faan karik, bele hetan osan liu fali ema badaen nia salariu tinan ida nian. Depois osan nee bele foo ba ema kiak.” Nunee sira siak loos feto nee.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Maibee Jesus dehan, “Nia halo ona buat furak mai Hau. Husik nia halo ba! Imi keta hirus nia. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Ema kiak sira sempre iha imi nia leet. Bainhira deit mak imi hakarak ajuda sira, bele deit. Maibee Hau laos atu hela nafatin ho imi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Deuteronómiu 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Feto nee halo tiha ona buat nebee nia bele. Nia fui mina morin nee hodi prepara Hau nia isin molok atu hakoi. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, aban-bainrua bainhira ema foo sai Liafuan Diak iha mundu tomak, sira mos sei konta kona ba buat nebee mak nia halo mai Hau, atu ema hanoin nafatin nia.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas hanoin aat atu faan Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateus 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Lucas 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Depois Judas Iscariotes, eskolante ida husi sanulu resin rua nee, baa hasoru nai lulik nia ulun sira para bele faan Jesus ba sira. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Rona nunee sira kontenti teb-tebes, i sira promete atu foo osan ba nia. Judas mos konkorda. Nunee nia komesa buka dalan atu entrega Jesus ba sira.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus haan hamutuk ho Nia eskolante sira iha festa Paskua</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-30">Mateus 26:17-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Lucas 22:7-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">João 13:21-30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korintu 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Festa Paun la Tau Fermentu hahuu ona. Iha loron primeiru, ema Judeu oho bibi malae oan para kalan bele selebra festa Paskua. Iha loron nee Jesus nia eskolante sira baa husu Nia dehan, “Ita Boot hakarak ami baa prepara hahaan atu selebra festa Paskua iha nebee?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Depois Jesus haruka Nia eskolante nain rua hodi dehan ba sira, “Imi baa iha sidade Jerusalém. Too iha nebaa imi sei hasoru mane ida lori hela sanan rai ho bee iha laran, imi tuir deit nia. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Nia tama ba uma nebee, imi mos tama hodi hatete ba uma nain nunee: ‘Mestri husu kona ba fatin nebee mak prepara ona ba Nia atu haan hamutuk ho Nia eskolante sira hodi selebra festa Paskua. Fatin nee iha nebee?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Depois uma nain sei hatudu salaun ida iha uma andar leten, nia prepara tiha ona fatin nee. Hela deit imi nain rua baa prepara hahaan iha nebaa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Nunee sira nain rua baa ona. Too iha sidade, sira hetan buat hotu-hotu tuir lo-loos saida mak Jesus ohin hatete ba sira. I sira halo preparasaun ba festa Paskua iha nebaa.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Bainhira kalan ona, Jesus ho Nia eskolante nain sanulu resin rua too iha uma. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Sira haan daudaun iha meza, Jesus dehan, “Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, husi imi sira nebee haan hamutuk ho Hau agora dadauk, ida sei faan Hau ba Hau nia inimigu sira.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Salmu 41:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Rona nunee, Nia eskolante sira tristi teb-tebes. I sira ida-ida husu ba Nia dehan, “Laos hau, loos ka lae?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jesus hataan, “Ema nebee mak atu faan Hau nee, ema ida husi imi nain sanulu resin rua nebee agora haan lisuk ho Hau iha manko. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan tenki mate duni tuir buat nebee hakerek tiha ona iha Livru Sagradu. Maibee ema nebee faan Hau nee, sei terus teb-tebes. Diak liu uluk kedas nia lalika moris.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Sira haan hela, Jesus foti paun hodi foo agradese ba Maromak. Nia silu paun nee hodi fahe ba sira dehan, “Simu ba. Nee Hau nia isin.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Depois Nia foti tua kopu ida. Nia foo agradese ba Maromak, i foo ba Nia eskolante sira hotu hemu. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Nia dehan ba sira, “Tua nee Hau nia raan. Liu husi Hau nia raan fakar mak Maromak kumpri Nia promesa hodi hamoos ema barak nia sala.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Ézodu 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jeremias 31:31-34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Hau hatete lo-loos ba imi, Hau sei la hemu tan tua nee. Bainhira Maromak ukun nudar Liurai iha mundu foun mak foin Hau hemu fali tua foun.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Hotu tiha Jesus ho Nia eskolante sira kanta hamutuk hodi hahii Maromak. Depois sira sai ba iha foho Oliveira.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus dehan, Pedro sei nega Nia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateus 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lucas 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">João 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Jesus hatete ba Nia eskolante sira dehan, “Imi hotu-hotu sei halai husik hela Hau. Tanba iha Livru Sagradu hakerek dehan, ‘Hau sei oho tiha bibi atan, i bibi sira sei halai namkari hotu.’<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zacarias 13:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Hau sei mate duni. Maibee bainhira Hau moris fali, Hau baa hein imi iha provinsia Galileia.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mateus 28:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pedro hataan, “Maski sira hotu halai namkari, maibee hau sei la halai.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jesus dehan ba nia, “Hau hatete lo-loos ba o, iha kalan nee duni, molok manu kokoreek dala rua, o sei nega Hau dala tolu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Pedro hataan ho makaas dehan, “Maski hau tenki mate hamutuk ho Ita Boot mos, hau sei la nega.” Eskolante sira seluk mos hataan hanesan.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus halo orasaun iha toos Getsémani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateus 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Lucas 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Depois sira baa iha fatin ida naran Getsémani. Too iha nebaa, Jesus hatete ba Nia eskolante sira, “Imi tuur iha nee, Hau sei baa halo orasaun lai.”<verse eid="MRK 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Nia lao tan uitoan, lori Pedro, Tiago ho João. Iha tempu nee Jesus nia laran susar teb-tebes i la hakmatek. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Jesus hatete ba sira nain tolu, “Hau nia laran susar teb-tebes, too senti atu besik mate ona. Imi hein iha nee hodi hadeer nafatin.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Jesus lao tan uitoan husi sira, depois Nia taka rabat ba rai hodi harohan atu se bele karik terus ida nee la bele kona Nia. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Nia husu, “Hau nia Aman doben, Ita Boot bele halo buat hotu-hotu. Hasai tiha terus ida nee husi Hau. Maibee la bele halo tuir Hau nia hakarak, halo tuir deit Ita Boot nia hakarak.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Depois Nia fila fali ba nia eskolante nain tolu nee, Nia haree sira toba dukur hela. Nia hatete ba Simão Pedro, “Simão, o dukur ka? O atu hadeer deit oras ida hamutuk ho Hau mos la bele ka?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Depois Jesus hatete ba sira nain tolu dehan, “Hadeer hodi halo orasaun atu imi la bele monu ba tentasaun. Tanba imi nia laran hakarak atu halo buat nebee loos, maibee imi ema nebee fraku.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:13">1 Korintu 10:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Dala ida tan Jesus baa halo orasaun ho liafuan nebee hanesan. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Bainhira Nia fila fali, Nia haree sira nain tolu toba fali, tanba sira nia matan dukur loos. Kuandu Nia fanu tan sira, sira la hatene atu koalia saida ba Nia.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Depois Jesus baa harohan tan, ida nee dala tolu ona. Hotu tiha Nia fila fali ba Nia eskolante sira hodi dehan, “Imi sei toba deskansa ka? Too ona! Agora oras too ona atu ema faan Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan ba iha ema aat nia liman. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Hadeer ona. Haree ba! Ema nebee mak faan Hau ba ema aat nee mai daudaun ona. Mai ita baa took iha sira.”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema kaer Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateus 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lucas 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">João 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Jesus sei koalia hela, Judas, eskolante ida husi sira nain sanulu resin rua nee, too mai. Ema barak mai hamutuk ho nia, lori surik ho ai dona. Ema sira nee, nai lulik nia ulun sira, mestri relijiaun sira ho katuas lia nain sira mak haruka. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Molok too iha nebaa, Judas foo tiha ona sinal ba sira dehan, “Ema nebee mak hau rei, Nia mak nee, imi kaer Nia hodi lori Nia ho seguransa metin.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Bainhira Judas too, nia baa kedas iha Jesus hodi dehan, “Mestri.” I nia rei Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Depois ema sira nee kaer Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Derepenti ema ida nebee hamriik iha nebaa losu nia surik hodi tesi kotu tiha ema ida nia tilun. Ema nee nai lulik boot nia atan.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jesus hatete ba ema barak nee dehan, “Nusaa mak imi mai lori surik ho ai dona atu kaer Hau? Imi hanoin Hau ema kriminozu ka? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Afinal loro-loron Hau hamutuk ho imi iha area uma kreda boot hodi hanorin, i imi la kaer Hau. Maibee saida mak akontese mai Hau nee tenki sai nunee duni tanba hakerek nanis ona iha Livru Sagradu.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Lucas 19:47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Depois Jesus nia eskolante sira husik hela Nia hodi halai namkari hotu.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Iha nebaa iha mane klosan ida nebee lao tuir Jesus, nia falun nia isin ho deit hena ida. Ema balu kaer nia, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />maibee nia halai sai ho isin tanan, husik hela nia hena iha sira nia liman laran.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Justisa nain relijiaun Judeu desidi Nai Jesus tenki mate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateus 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Lucas 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">João 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Depois ema nebee kaer Jesus, lori Nia ba iha nai lulik boot nia uma. Iha nebaa nai lulik nia ulun sira, katuas lia nain sira ho mestri relijiaun sira hotu halibur hamutuk ona atu foo justisa ba Jesus. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Pedro lao tu-tuir Jesus husi dook deit, i tama liu ba moru laran. Depois Nia tuur hamutuk ho ema seguransa sira iha uma oin hodi haneruk ahi.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Iha uma laran, nai lulik nia ulun sira ho justisa nain relijiaun Judeu sira seluk buka hela ema atu foo sasin para bele kastigu mate Jesus. Maibee justisa nain sira la hetan sala ida atu bele kastigu Nia. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Iha ema barak mai foo testemunhu falsu. Maibee testemunhu sira nee, liafuan la haan malu.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Depois ema balu hamriik hodi foo testemunhu falsu nunee: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Ami rona ema nee dehan, ‘Hau sei halo rahun uma kreda boot nebee ema halo ho liman nee. Depois iha loron tolu nia laran Hau sei harii fali uma kreda foun ida nebee laos ema mak halo.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:58: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">João 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Maibee sira nia liafuan nee mos la haan malu.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Depois nai lulik boot hamriik iha sira nia oin hodi husu Jesus, “Ema sira nee foo sasin tiha ona kona ba O nia sala. Nusaa mak O la hataan sira?” <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Maibee Jesus nonook deit, la hataan buat ida. Nunee nai lulik boot husu tan, “O mak Mesias, Nai Maromak nia Oan ka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jesus hataan, “Hau duni. Aban-bainrua imi sei haree Hau, Ema Umanu nia Oan tuur iha Maromak Kbiit Nain nia sorin loos. I imi sei haree Hau tuun mai husi lalehan iha kalohan laran.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:62: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniel 7:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Rona nunee, nai lulik boot nee hirus too lees tiha nia hena hodi dehan ba justisa nain sira, “Ita hein tan sasin seluk atu halo saida? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Imi rona rasik ona Nia liafuan. Nia hatete aat Maromak! Imi foo justisa oinsaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Justisa nain sira hotu hatuun desizaun katak Jesus merese mate.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:64: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Levítiku 24:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Depois ema balu tafui kabeen ba Jesus, sira kesi hena ba Nia matan, i baku Nia hodi husu, “He, Profeta, foo sai took, see mak baku O nee?” Depois sira entrega Jesus ba seguransa sira, i seguransa sira mos baku Nia.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pedro nega Nai Jesus dala tolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateus 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Lucas 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">João 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pedro sei tuur hela iha kraik iha uma oin, nai lulik boot nia kriada ida mai. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Nia haree Pedro haneruk hela ahi, nia fihir di-diak Pedro i dehan, “O mos hamutuk ho Jesus, Ema Nazaré nee.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Maibee Pedro nega dehan, “O hatete saida mak nee? Hau la kompriende o nia liafuan.” Depois Pedro hamriik hodi baa iha portaun. [Iha momentu nee kedas, manu kokoreek.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:68: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos husi tempu antigu barak. Balu temi manu kokoreek, balu lae.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Kriada nee haree tan nia i hatete ba ema nebee mak hamriik besik dehan, “Ema ida nee mos Jesus nia ema.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Pedro nega tan dala ida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">La kleur ema sira nebee hamriik iha nebaa dehan ba Pedro, “O nee Nia ema duni. Tanba o mos ema Galileia.”<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Maibee Pedro jura dehan, “Hau la konhese Ema nebee imi temi nee. Se hau bosok karik, husik Maromak kastigu hau ba.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Derepenti manu kokoreek dala ida tan. Rona nunee, Pedro hanoin fila fali liafuan nebee Jesus hatete ba nia dehan, “Molok manu kokoreek dala rua, o sei nega Hau dala tolu.” Entaun Pedro tanis ho laran dodok.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Ema lori Nai Jesus ba iha governador Pilatus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateus 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lucas 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">João 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Dadeer-saan deit, nai lulik nia ulun sira, katuas lia nain sira, mestri relijiaun sira ho justisa nain sira hotu foti desizaun kona ba Jesus nia mate. Entaun sira futu Nia i lori Nia baa entrega iha governador Pilatus.<verse eid="MRK 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Too iha nebaa Pilatus husu ba Jesus, “Loos ka? O mak ema Judeu sira nia Liurai duni ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jesus hataan, “Ita dehan nee loos.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Nai lulik nia ulun sira duun Jesus kona ba buat oi-oin deit. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Entaun Pilatus husu fila fali ba Jesus, “O lakohi hataan ka? Haree ba, sira foo sala ba O kona ba buat barak.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Maibee Jesus la hataan buat ida, nunee Pilatus admira.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Governador Pilatus hamonu kastigu mate ba Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateus 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lucas 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">João 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Tin-tinan, bainhira ema Judeu halo festa Paskua, povu husu governador atu hasai ema dadur ida, i governador sempre halo tuir. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Iha momentu nebaa iha ema ida naran Barabás kastigu hela iha komarka laran hamutuk ho nia maluk balu. Sira dadur hela tanba sira oho ema bainhira sira nia grupu halo rungu-ranga hasoru estadu Roma. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Iha tempu nee ema lubun boot baa husu Pilatus atu hasai tiha ema ida husi kadeia hanesan baibain.<verse eid="MRK 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilatus hataan, “Imi hakarak hau husik ema Judeu sira nia Liurai ka?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Nia koalia nunee tanba nia hatene hela nai lulik nia ulun sira laran moras ba Jesus, nee mak sira entrega Jesus ba nia.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Maibee nai lulik nia ulun sira tau lia ba ema barak nee atu husu ba Pilatus hodi hasai tiha Barabás ba sira.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Entaun Pilatus hatete ba ema barak nee, “Se nunee hau tenki halo saida ba Ema nebee imi bolu Judeu nia Liurai nee?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Sira hakilar makaas dehan, “Prega Nia ba krus!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Depois Pilatus husu ba sira, “Tansaa? Nia halo krimi saida?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Maibee sira hakilar makaas liu tan, “Prega tiha Nia ba krus!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Entaun Pilatus halo tuir sira nia hakarak hodi hasai Barabás husi kadeia. I nia haruka ema baku Jesus ho sikoti, depois entrega Jesus ba soldadu sira atu prega iha krus.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soldadu sira hamoe Nai Jesus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateus 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">João 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Hotu tiha soldadu sira lori Jesus ba iha governador Pilatus nia rezidensia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:16: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tradusaun balu hakerek “Praetóriu”. Nee lian Latin hodi hatudu ba governador nia palasiu.</char></note> Sira bolu sira nia maluk soldadu sira halibur hamutuk hotu iha nebaa. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Depois sira foo hatais batina kor mean ida ba Jesus. Sira mos dulas ai tarak halo kabuar hanesan koroa liurai nian hodi tau ba Nia ulun.<verse eid="MRK 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Sira goza Nia hodi kumprimenta fila-fila dehan, “Viva, ema Judeu sira nia Liurai!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Sira baku Jesus nia ulun fila-fila ho ai tonka, i tafui kabeen ba Nia. Sira mos finji hakneak hakruuk iha Nia oin. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Sira hamoe tiha Nia, sira kolu fali batina mean nee hodi foo hatais Nia hena rasik. Hotu tiha sira lori Nia sai atu baa prega iha krus.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema prega Nai Jesus iha krus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateus 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lucas 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">João 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Iha dalan klaran, iha ema ida naran Simão, Alexandre ho Rufu nia aman, husi sidade Sirene, nia mai husi foho atu tama ba sidade. Soldadu sira obriga Simão nee hulan Jesus nia krus.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:13">Roma 16:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Sira lori Jesus ba iha Golgota, katak “Fatin Ulun Ruin”. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Iha nebaa sira kahur tua ho aimoruk hodi foo ba Jesus, maibee Nia lakohi hemu. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Depois sira prega Jesus iha krus. I soldadu sira dada rifa atu hatene see mak bele hetan Nia hena ida-idak. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Oras nebee sira prega Jesus ba iha krus nee tuku sia dadeer.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Salmu 22:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Iha ai kabelak ida nebee hakerek razaun saida mak Jesus simu kastigu mate. Iha ai kabelak nee hakerek nunee: “Ema Judeu sira nia Liurai.”<verse eid="MRK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Sira prega tan ema naok-teen boot nain rua iha krus, ida iha Jesus nia sorin loos, ida iha Nia sorin karuk. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Nee tuir saida mak hakerek iha Livru Sagradu dehan, “Ema konsidera Nia hanesan ema nebee kontra Maromak nia lei.”]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos husi tempu antigu barak, Versikulu 28 nee tama iha kopia nee balu, maibee iha kopia nebee antigu liu la tama.</char></note> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isaias 53:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Ema nebee liu husi fatin nee, sira doko ulun hodi koalia aat Jesus. Sira hatete, “Hei! Uluk O dehan atu halo rahun uma kreda boot, depois harii fali iha loron tolu nia laran.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Salmu 22:8</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Marcos 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">João 2:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Entaun salva took O nia Aan hodi tuun husi krus nee.”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Nai lulik nia ulun sira ho mestri relijiaun sira mos hatete aat Jesus. Sira dehan ba malu, “Nia salva ona ema seluk, maibee Nia la bele salva Nia Aan rasik. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Nia dehan, Nia mak Mesias, ema Israel nia Liurai, entaun diak liu agora Nia tuun husi krus atu ita haree i fiar Nia.” Ema nain rua nebee prega iha krus hamutuk ho Jesus mos hatete aat Nia fila-fila.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus mate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateus 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lucas 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">João 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Komesa meudia, nakukun taka metin rejiaun nee tomak too tuku tolu lokraik. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Iha tuku tolu lokraik, Jesus hakilar ho lian makaas dehan, <char style="it">“Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani?</char>” Nee dehan, “Hau nia Maromak, Hau nia Maromak, tansaa mak Ita Boot husik Hau mesak?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Liafuan </char><char style="it">“Eloi, Eloi, lama sabaktani</char>” nee lian Aram.</note> <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Salmu 22:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Rona nunee, ema balu nebee hamriik besik dehan, “Imi rona ba! Nia bolu profeta Elias.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ema ida halai baa foti esponza rohan ida habokon ho tua siin, tau ba ai naruk ida hodi lolo ba iha Jesus nia ibun atu Nia hemu. Ema nee dehan, “Hein lai! Ita haree took, Elias mai hatuun Nia husi krus ka lae?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Salmu 69:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Depois Jesus hakilar tan ho lian makaas, i Nia iis mos kotu.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Bainhira Jesus nia iis kotu, kurtina boot nebee taka fatin lulik iha uma kreda boot, naklees husi leten too kraik fahe tiha ba rua.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Ézodu 26:31-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Komandante nebee hamriik iha krus oin nee haree Jesus nia mate oinsaa. I nia dehan, “Loos duni! Ema nee Maromak nia Oan.”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Iha nebaa iha senhora balu asisti husi dook deit. Sira nee mak Maria Madalena, Maria ida Tiago kiik ho José nia inan, ho mos Salomé. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Sira nain tolu nee uluk tuir Jesus iha rai Galileia hodi serbi Nia. Iha tan feto barak mak uluk mai iha Jerusalém hamutuk ho Nia.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Lucas 8:2-3</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ema hakoi Nai Jesus nia mate isin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateus 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lucas 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">João 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Loron nee Sesta, loron atu prepara ba Sabadu, ema Judeu nia loron deskansa. Rai atu kalan ona, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />nunee José husi sidade Arimateia brani baa hasoru Pilatus hodi husu Jesus nia mate isin. José nee membru ida nebee konhesidu iha tribunal relijiaun Judeu nian, i nia hein hela Maromak atu ukun nudar Liurai. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Bainhira Pilatus rona katak Jesus mate tiha ona, nia hakfodak. Nunee nia haruka ema baa bolu komandante mai hodi husu, Jesus mate ona ka seidauk. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Rona hotu tiha informasaun husi komandante, Pilatus foo lisensa ba José hodi foti Jesus nia mate isin.<verse eid="MRK 15:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Nunee José baa sosa hena mutin diak nian. Depois nia baa hatuun Jesus nia mate isin husi krus hodi falun ho hena nee, i nia lori baa haloot iha rate. Rate nee fatuk lolon nebee ema bahat tiha ona atu sai rate. Hotu tiha nia duir fatuk boot ida hodi taka rate kuak.<verse eid="MRK 15:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maria Madalena ho Maria ida José nia inan haree hela fatin nebee mak sira haloot Jesus nia mate isin.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus moris fila fali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateus 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Lucas 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">João 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Loron Sabadu liu ona, Maria Madalena, Maria ida Tiago nia inan ho Salomé baa sosa ai been morin atu lori baa tau iha Jesus nia mate isin. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Iha Domingu dadeer-saan, bainhira loro matan foin sae, sira baa iha rate. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Iha dalan klaran sira husu ba malu, “Orsida see mak sei ajuda ita hodi duir fatuk boot nebee taka rate nee?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Maibee too iha rate, sira hateke sae, sira haree fatuk boot teb-tebes nee muda sees tiha ona. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Depois sira tama ba iha rate laran. Sira haree ba liman loos, iha mane klosan ida hatais batina mutin tuur hela. Haree nunee sira hakfodak ho tauk. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Depois nia hatete ba sira dehan, “La bele hakfodak. Hau hatene imi buka hela Jesus, ema Nazaré, Ida nebee ema prega tiha ona ba krus nee. Nia moris fali ona, Nia la iha nee ona! Mai haree fatin nebee mak ema tau Nia mate isin nee. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Agora, imi baa foo hatene Nia eskolante sira ho mos Pedro dehan nunee: ‘Nia sei baa iha Galileia hodi hein imi, i imi sei haree Nia iha nebaa, hanesan Nia hatete tiha ona ba imi.’ ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mateus 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Marcos 14:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Feto sira nee hakfodak too nakdedar. Sira sai husi rate hodi halai. Sira la foo hatene ba ema ida, tanba sira tauk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kopia evanjelhu Marcos nian husi tempu antigu barak. Kopia nebee antigu liu too deit versikulu 8. Maibee balu hakerek tan versikulu 9-20. I balu hakerek versikulu 9-10 hanesan tuir mai: </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Bainhira feto nain tolu nee too iha Pedro ho nia maluk sira, sira konta badak deit buat hotu nebee mane klosan nee ohin hatete ba sira. Iha loron ida Jesus rasik haruka Nia eskolante sira baa iha mundu tomak, husi lorosae too loro monu. Nia haruka sira foo sai Nia liafuan kona ba salvasaun nebee Maromak foo too tinan ba tinan. Liafuan nee nunka hotu nunka remata. </char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">[Nai Jesus hatudu Aan ba Nia eskolante sira</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateus 28:9-10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:13-49">Lucas 24:13-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-23">João 20:11-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Iha Domingu dadeer-saan bainhira Jesus moris fali husi mate, Nia hatudu Nia Aan uluk ba Maria Madalena. Maria nee uluk Jesus duni sai espiritu aat hitu husi nia laran. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Haree tiha Jesus, Maria baa atu foo hatene ba ema sira nebee tuir Jesus. Too iha nebaa, sira tristi ho tanis hela. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Maibee bainhira Maria konta katak Jesus moris fali ona, i Maria haree tiha ona Nia, sira la fiar.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Depois Jesus hatudu nia Aan ba Nia eskolante nain rua nebee lao tuir dalan atu baa iha aldeia ida. Iha momentu nebaa Jesus nia oin seluk tiha. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Haree tiha Nia, sira nain rua fila fali baa foo hatene eskolante sira seluk, maibee eskolante sira seluk la fiar nafatin.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Hotu tiha Jesus hatudu Aan ba Nia eskolante sanulu resin ida. Iha tempu nebaa Nia eskolante sira haan hela, Nia hasee sira tanba sira ulun toos i lakohi fiar ema sira nebee mak haree tiha ona Nia moris fali husi mate.<verse eid="MRK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Depois Jesus hatete ba sira, “Imi baa iha mundu tomak hodi foo sai Hau nia Liafuan Diak ba ema hotu-hotu.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Ema nebee fiar hodi simu batizmu, Maromak sei salva nia. Maibee see mak la fiar, sei hetan kastigu. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Sira nebee fiar mai Hau, sei halo milagre hodi hatudu Maromak nia kbiit, hanesan tuir mai nee: Sira sei duni sai diabu hodi Hau nia naran. Sira sei koalia ho lian nebee mak sira nunka aprende. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bainhira sira kaer samea ka hemu veneno, sira diak hela. I sira tula liman ba ema moras, ema moras sira nee sei hetan kura.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nai Jesus sae ba lalehan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lucas 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Nai Jesus koalia hotu tiha, Maromak foti Nia sae ba lalehan, i Nia tuur iha Maromak nia liman loos.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Apostolu sira nia Istoria 1:9-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="MRK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Depois Nia eskolante sira baa foo sai Liafuan Diak iha nebee-nebee. Nai Jesus servisu hamutuk ho sira. Nia foo kbiit ba sira hodi halo milagre, i milagre sira nee hatudu katak Liafuan Diak nebee sira foo sai nee loos.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>